hadiths[362]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6173","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ibne-Sayyaad ki taraf gaey. bahut se doosrey sahaba bhi sath they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke wo chand bachchon ke sath bani maghaala ke qile ke paas khel raha hai. un dinon ibne-Sayyaad buloogh ke qareeb tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aamad ka usey ehsas nahi hua. yahan tak ke aap ne uski peeth par apna hath maara . phir farmaya kya to gawahi deta hai ke main Allah ka rasool hoon? us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekh kar kaha, mein gawahi deta hun ke aap ummiyon ke yani ( Arbon ke) rasool hain. phir ibne-Sayyaad ne kaha kya aap gawahi detey hain ke main Allah ka rasool hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par usey dafa' kar diya aur farmaya, mein Allah aur uske rasool par eman laya. phir ibne-Sayyaad se aap ne poochha, tum kya dekhtey ho? usne kaha ke mere paas sachcha aur jhoota donon aatey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tumharey liye maamle ko mushtabah kar diya gaya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumharey liye aik baat apne dil mein chipa rakhi hai? usne kaha ke wo ( الدخ‏ ( hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke door ho, apni haisiyat se aagey na badh . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya aap mujhey ijazat dengey ke usey qatl kar dun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar ye wahi ( dajjal ( hai to is par ghalib nahi hua ja sakta aur agar ye dajjal nahi hai to usey qatl karne mein koi khair nahi."
"6174","iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ubai-bin-Kab Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ko sath lekar us khajoor ke baagh ki taraf rawaana huey jahan ibne-Sayyaad rehta tha. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baagh mein pahunchey to aap ne khajoor ki tahniyon mein chhipnaa shuru kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chahtey they ke us se pahley ke wo dekhey chhup kar kisi bahaney ibne-Sayyaad ki koi baat sunein. ibne-Sayyaad aik makhmalii chadar ke bistar par leta hua tha aur kuchh gungunaa raha tha. ibne-Sayyaad ki maan ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khajoor ke tanon se chhup kar aatey huey dekh liya aur usey bata diya ke aey saaf! (ye iska naam tha) Muhammad aa rahe hain. chunanche wo mutanabbeh ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar uski maan usey mutanabbeh na karti to baat saaf ho jati."
"6175","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke majma' mein khadey huey aur Allah ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef karne ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dajjal ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke main tumhen us se daraataa hun. koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jisne apni qaum ko us se na daraayaa ho. Nuh (Alaihissalam) ne apni qaum ko us se daraayaa lekin main uski tumhen aik aisi nishani bataunga jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum ko nahi batai tum jantey ho ke wo kaana hoga aur Allah kaana nahi hai."
"6176","jab qabila abdul-Qais ka wafad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke marhaba un logon ko jo aan pahunchey to na wo zaleel huey, na sharminda (khushii se musalman ho gaey warna maarey jatey sharminda hotey ( unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ham qabila Rabe ki shaakh se talluq rakhtey hain aur chunkey hamarey aur aap ke darmyan qabila muzar ke kaafir log rukawat hain isliye ham aap ki khidmat mein sirf hurmat waley mahinon hi mein hazir ho saktey hain (jin mein loot-khasot nahi hoti (aap kuchh aisi jachii-tulii baat bata dein jis par amal karne se ham jannat mein dakhil ho jayen aur jo log nahi aa sakey hain unhein bhi uski dawat pahunchaaein . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke char chaar cheezein hain. Namaz qaaim karo, zakat do, Ramazan ke rozey rakho aur ghaneemat ka panchwan hissey ( baitul-maal ko) ada karo aur dabbaa, hantam, naqeer aur muzaffat mein na piyo."
"6177","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ahad todney waley ke liye qiyamat mein aik jhanda uthaya jaeyga aur pukar diya jaeyga ke ye falan bin falan ki daghaa bazi ka nishan hai.''"
"6178","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ahad todney waley ke liye qiyamat mein aik jhanda uthaya jaeyga aur pukara jaeyga ke ye falan bin falan ki daghaa bazi ka nishan hai.''"
"6179","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein koi shakhs ye na kahey ke mera nafs paleed ho gaya hai balke ye kahey ke mera dil kharaab ya pareshan ho gaya. ''"
"6180","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se koi hargiz yun na kahey ke mera nafs paleed ho gaya lekin yun keh sakta hai ke mera dil kharaab ya pareshan ho gaya. ''is hadis ko Aqeel ne bhi ibne-Shahab se riwayat kya hai."""
"6181","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke insan zamana ko gali deta hai halanke main hi zamana hun, mere hi hath mein raat aur din hain.''"
"6182","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''angoor (inab) ko (karam) na kaho aur ye na kaho ke haaye zamana ki naamuraadii. kyonke zamana to Allah hi ke ikhtiyar mein hai.''"
"6183","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''log (angoor ko) ( karam ( kehtey hain, ( karam ( to momin ka dil hai.''"
"6184","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kisi ke liye apne aapko qurbaan karne ka lafz kehtey nahi suna, siwa Sad-bin-abi-Waqas ke. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they. teer mar , aey Sad ! mere maan-baap tum par qurbaan hon, mera khayal hai ke ye Uhud ki jang ke mauqe par farmaya,"
"6185","wo aur abu-Talha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (Madina Munawra ke liye) rawaana huey. Ummul-Momenin Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey thin, raaste mein kisi jagah ontni ka paon phisal gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Ummul-Momenin gir gaey. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai abu-Talha ne apni sawari se fauran apne ko gira diya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunch gaey aur arz kya : ya Nabi Allah ! Allah aap par mujhey qurbaan karey kya aapko koi chot aai ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, albatta aurat ko dekho . chunanche abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kapda apne chehrey par daal liya, phir Ummul-Momenin ki taraf badhey aur apna kapda unke uper daal diya. iske baad wo khadi ho gain aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Ummul-Momenin ke liye abu-Talha ne paalaan mazbut baandhaa. ab aap ne Sawar ho kar phir safar shuru kya, jab Madina Munawra ke qareeb pahunchey (ya yun kaha ke Madina dikhai dene laga ( to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ham lotney waley hain tauba kartey huey apne rab ki ibadat kartey huey aur uski hamd bayan kartey huey.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey barabar kehtey rahe yahan tak ke Madina mein dakhil ho gaey."
"6186","ham mein se aik sahib ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne iska naam Qasim rakha. ham ne unse kaha ke ham tum ko abul-Qaasim keh kar nahi pukaarengey (kyonke abul-Qaasim Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kunniyat thi) aur na ham tumhari izzat ke liye aisa karengey. un sahib ne uski khabar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne betey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh ley."
"6187","ham mein se aik shakhs ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne iska naam Qasim rakha. sahaba ne unse kaha ke jab tak ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se na poochh lein. ham us naam par tumhari kunniyat nahi honey dengey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat na ikhtiyar karo."
"6188","abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat na rakho .''"
"6189","ham mein se aik aadmi ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne uska naam Qasim rakha. sahaba ne kaha ke ham tumhari kunniyat abul-Qaasim nahi rakhengey aur na teri aankh us kunniyat se pukar kar thandii karengey. wo shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur aap se iska zikr kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne ladkey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh lo."
"6190","unke walid (huzn bin abi wahab) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai? unhon-ne bataya ke) huzn ( ) ba-maanaa sakhti ( . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ( سهل ( ) ba-maanaa narmii ( ho, phir unhon-ne kaha ke mera naam mere walid rakh gaey hain usey mein nahi badloon ga . ibne-Musaiyab (Rahmatullahi-alaih) bayan kartey they ke chunanche hamarey khandan mein baad tak hamesha sakhti aur museebat ka daur raha."
"6191","munzir bin abi Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki wilaadat hui to unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bachcha ko apni raan par rakh liya. abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) baithey huey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi cheez mein jo samney thi masroof ho gaey (aur bachcha ki taraf tawajjoh hat gai) . abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne bachcha ke mutaalliq hukm diya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan se utha liya gaya. phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mutwajjeh huey to farmaya ke bachcha kahan hai? abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham ne usey ghar bhej diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : iska naam kya hai? arz kya ke fulaan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, balke iska naam munzir hai. chunanche isi din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka yahi naam munzir rakha."
"6192","Ummul-Momenin Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ka naam barra tha, kaha janey laga ke wo apni paakii zahir karti hain. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam Zenab rakha."
"6193","main Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ke paas betha hua tha to unhon-ne mujh se bayan kya ke unke dada huzn Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke mera naam huzn hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum Sehal ho, unhon-ne kaha ke main to apne bap ka rakha hua naam nahi badloonga. Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne kaha iske baad se ab tak hamarey khandan mein sakhti aur museebat hi rahi. ( حزونة ( se suoobat murad hai."
"6194","maine ibne-abii-Aufii se poochha. tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahibzadey Ibrahim ko dekha tha? bayan kya ke unki wafat bachpan hi mein ho gaee thi aur agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad kisi Nabi ki aamad hoti to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahibzadey zinda rahtey lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad koi Nabi nahi aayega ."
"6195","jab aap ke farzand Ibrahim ka intiqal hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' uske liye jannat mein aik doodh pilaaney wali daaya muqarrar ho gaee hai.''"
"6196","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunniyat na ikhtiyar karo kyonke main Qasim ( taqseem karne wala ( hun aur tumharey darmyan (deen ke ilm ko) taqseem karta hoon.'' aur is riwayat ko Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kya."
"6197","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mere naam par naam rakho lekin tum meri kunniyat na ikhtiyar karo aur jisne mujhey khuwab mein dekha to usne mujhey hi dekha kyonke shaitan meri sura mein nahi aa sakta aur jisne qasdan meri taraf koi jhooti baat mansub ki us ne apna thikana jahannam mein bana liyaa.''"
"6198","mere yahan aik bachcha paida hua to main usey lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska naam Ibrahim rakha aur aik khajoor apne munh mein narm karke iske munh mein dali aur uske liye barkat ki dua ki phir usey mujhey de diya. ye abu-Musa ki badi aulad thi."
"6199","jis din Ibrahim (Raziallahu anhu) ki wafat hui us din suraj girahan hua tha. usko Abu-Bakra ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya hai."
"6200","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sar Mubarak rukoo se uthaya to ye dua ki اللهم أنج الوليد بن الوليد وسلمة بن هشام ، Mina وعياش بن أبي ربيعة ، Mina والمستضعفين بمكة ''aey Allah ! Waleed bin Waleed, Salma bin Hishaam, Ayash bin abi Rabee aur Makka mein doosrey maujood kamzor musalmanon ko nijat de-dey. '' اللهم اشدد وطأتك على مضر ، Mina اللهم اجعلها عليهم سنين كسني يوسف ''aey Allah ! qabila Muzar ke kaafiron ko sakht pakad, aey Allah ! un par Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke zamane jaisa qahat nazil farmaa. ''"
"6201","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Aaisha! ye Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) hain aur tumhen salam kehtey hain.'' maine kaha aur un par bhi salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wo cheezein dekhtey they jo ham nahi dekhtey they."
"6202","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) musaafiron ke saman ke sath thin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghulam anjasha aurton ke oont ko haank rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''anjash! zara is tarah aahisatagi se ley chal jaisey sheeshon ko lekar jata hai.''"
"6203","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) husne-akhlaaq mein sab logon se badh kar they, mera aik bhai abu-umair naam ke tha. bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke bachche ka doodh chhoot chuka tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab tashrif latey to us se mazaaq mein farmatey aey Umer tumhaara nughair naami parinda kahan hai?"" aksar aisa hota ke Namaz ka waqt ho jata aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey ghar mein hotey . aap us bistar ko bichhaaney ka hukm detey jis par aap baithey huey hotey "
"6204","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko unki kunniyat abu-Turaab sabse zyada pyari thi aur is kunniyat se unhein pukara jata to bahut khush hotey they kyonke ye kunniyat abu-Turaab khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rakhi thi. aik din Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se khafa ho kar wo bahar chaley aaey aur masjid ki diwar ke paas let gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke peechhey aaey aur farmaya ke ye to diwar ke paas letey huey hain. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki peeth mitti se bhar chuki thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki peeth se mitti jhaadtey huey ( piyaar se) farmaney lagey abu-Turaab uth jao ."
"6205","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sabse badtareen naam uska hoga jo apna naam shahanshaah rakhey.''"
"6206","Allah ke nazdeek sabse badtareen naam aur kabhi Sufiyan ne aik se zyada martaba ye riwayat is tarah bayan ki ke Allah ke nazdeek sabse badtareen naamon (jama ke seeghey ke saath) mein uska naam hoga jo ''shahanshaah'' apna naam rakhega. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke abu-Zinaad ke ghair ne kaha ke iska mafhoom hai'' shaahaan Shah '' ."
"6207","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik gadhey par Sawar huey jis par fidak ka bana hua aik kapda bichhaa hua tha, Usama aap ke peechhey sawar they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bani Haris bin khazraj mein Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif ley ja rahe they, ye waqia jange-badr se pahley ka hai ye donon rawaana huey aur rastey mein aik majlis se guzrey jis mein Abdullah-bin-Ubai ibne-Salool bhi tha. Abdullah ne abhi tak apne Islam ka elaan nahi kya tha. us majlis mein kuchh musalman bhi they. buton ki parastish karne waley kuchh mushrekeen bhi they aur kuchh Yahudi bhi they. musalman shurakaa mein Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha bhi they. jab majlis par (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki) sawari ka ghubaar ud kar padaa to Abdullah-bin-Ubai ne apni chadar naak par rakh li aur kehney laga ke ham par ghubaar na udaao, iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (qareeb pahunchne ke baad) unhein salam kya aur khadey ho gaey. phir sawari se utar kar unhein Allah ki taraf bulaya aur Quran Majeed ki aayatein unhein padh kar sunaiin. is par Abdullah-bin-Ubai ibne-Salool ne kaha ke bhaley aadmi jo kalam tum ne padha us se behtar kalam nahi ho sakta. agarche waqei ye haq hai magar hamari majlison mein aa kar uski wjah se hamein takleef na diya karo. jo tumharey paas jaey bas usko ye qissey suna diya karo. Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : zaroor, ya Rasulullah ! aap hamari majlison mein bhi tashrif laya karein kyonke ham usey pasand kartey hain. us maamle par muslmaanon, mushrikon aur yahudiyon ka jhagdaa ho gaya aur qareeb tha ke aik doosrey ke khilaf hath utha dein. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein khamosh kartey rahe aakhir jab sab log khamosh ho gaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawari par baithey aur rawaana huey. jab Sad-bin-Ubada ke yahan pahunchey to unse farmaya ke aey Sad! tum ne nahi suna aaj abu-Hubaab ne kis tarah baatein ki hain. aap ka ishara Abdullah-bin-Ubai ki taraf tha ke usne ye baatein kahi hain Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) boley, mera bap aap par qurbaan ho, ya Rasulullah! aap usey maaf farma dein aur us se darguzar farmaaein, us zaat ki qism jisne aap par kitab nazil ki hai Allah ne aapko sachcha kalam de kar yahan bheja jo aap par utara . aap ke tashrif laney se pahley us Shahar (Madina munawwara) ke baashindey is par muttafiq ho gaey they ke usey (Abdullaah-bin-Ubaii ko) shahi taaj pehna dein aur shahi amama baandh dein lekin Allah ne sachcha kalam de kar aapko yahan bhej diya aur ye tajwiz moquf rahi to wo uski wjah se chid gaya aur jo kuchh aap ne aaj mulaahaza kya, wo usi jalan ki wjah se hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah-bin-Ubai ko maaf kar diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke sahaaba, mushrekeen aur ahle-kitab se jaisa ke unhein Allah Taala ne hukm diya tha. darguzar kya kartey they aur unki taraf se pahunchne wali takleefon par sabr kya kartey they. Allah Taala ne bhi irshad farmaya hai ke ''tum un logon se jinhein kitab di gaee hai (azeeyat deh baatein) sunogey.'' doosrey mauqe par irshad farmaya ''bahut se ahle-kitab khahish rakhtey hain.'' chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein maaf karne ke liye Allah ke hukm ke mutabiq taujeeh kya kartey they. bil-aakhir aapko ( jang ki) ijazat di gaee. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jange-badr kya aur Allah ke hukm se usmein kuffaar ke badey badey bahaadur aur Quraish ke sardaar qatl kiye gaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaba ke sath fateh mand aur ghaneemat ka maal liye huey wapas huey, unke sath kuffaare-Quraish ke kitney hi bahaadur sardaar qaid bhi karke laey to us waqt Abdullaah-bin-Ubaii-bin-salool aur uske but-parast mushrik sathi kehney lagey ke ab unka kaam jam gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait kar lo, us waqt unhon-ne Islam par bait ki aur bazahir musalman ho gaey (magar dil mein nifaq rahaa)."
"6208","unhon-ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! aap ne janab abu-Taalib ko unki wafat ke baad koi fayda pahunchaayaa, wo aap ki hifazat kya kartey they aur aap ke liye logon par ghussa hua kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, wo dozakh mein us jagah par hain jahan takhnon tak aag hai agar main na hota to wo dozakh ke nichey ke tabqey mein rehtey."
"6209","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein they, raaste mein hudi (padhneywaaley ne) hudi padhi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey anjasha! sheeshon ko ahista-ahista lekar chal, tujh par afsos.''"
"6210","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein they, anjasha naam ke ghulam aurton ki sawaariyon ko qurbani ka janwar padhta lekar chal raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ''anjasha! sheeshon ko aahista ley chal.'' abu-Qilaba ne bayan kya ke murad auratein thin."
"6211","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik hudi padhney waaley they anjasha naam ke unki awaz badi achi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ''anjasha! aahista chaal ikhtiyar kar, un sheeshon ko mat tod.'' Qatada ne bayan kya ke murad kamzor auratein thin (ke sawari se gir na jaaein)."
"6212","Madina Munawra par (eik raat naa-maaloom awaz ki wjah se) dar taarii ho gaya. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) abu-Talha ke aik ghodey par Sawar huey. phir (waapas aa kar) farmaya ''hamein to koi ( khof ki) cheez nazar na aaii, albatta ye ghoda to maano dariya tha.''"
"6213","kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaahinon ke barey mein poochha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke unki (pesheen goiyon ki) koi haisiyat nahi. sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! lekin wo kabhi-kabhi aisi baatein kartey hain jo sahi Sabit hoti hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo baat, sachchii baat hoti hai jisey jin farishton se sun kar uda leta hai aur phir usey apne wali (kaahin) ke kaan mein murgh ki awaz ki tarah daalta hai. iske baad kaahin us (eik sachchii baat) mein so se zyada jhoot mila detey hain."
"6214","mujhey Jabir-bin-Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir mere paas wahi aaney ka silsile band ho gaya. aik din mein chal raha tha ke maine aasman ki taraf se aik awaz suni, maine aasman ki taraf nazar uthai to maine phir us farishta ko dekha jo mere paas ghare-hira mein aaya tha, wo aasman w zameen ke darmyan kursi par betha hua tha."
"6215","maine aik raat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) (khaala) ke ghar guzaarii, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi us raat wahin thahrey huey they. jab raat ka aakhiri tehai hissey hua ya uska kuchh hissey reh gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uth baithey aur aasman ki taraf dekha phir is aayat ki tilawat ki إن في خلق السموات والأرض واختلاف الليل والنهار لآيات لأولي الألباب‏ ''bila shubah aasman ki aur zameen ki paidaaish main aur din raat ke badaltey rehney mein aql walon ke liye nishaniyan hain.''"
"6216","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke baaghon mein se aik baagh mein they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik lakdi thi, aap usko pani aur keechad mein mar rahe they. us doran mein aik sahib ne baagh ka darwaza khulwaanaa chaha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke uske liye darwaza khol de aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri suna de. main gaya to wahan Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they, maine unke liye darwaza khola aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri sunai phir aik aur sahib ne darwaza khulwaayaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke darwaza khol de aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri suna de is martaba umr (Raziallahu anhu) they. maine unke liye bhi darwaza khola aur unhein bhi jannat ki khushkhabri suna di. phir aik teesrey sahib ne darwaza khulwaayaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt tek lagaey huey they ab seedhey baith gaey. phir farmaya darwaza khol de aur jannat ki khushkhabri suna de, un aazmaaishon ke sath jis se (duniyaa mein) unhein do-chaar hona padega. main gaya to wahan Usman (Raziallahu anhu) they. unke liye bhi maine darwaza khola aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri sunai aur wo baat bhi bata di jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai thi. Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha khair Allah madadgaar hai."
"6217","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik janaaza mein Sharik they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik chhadi thi usko aap zameen par mar rahe they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein koi aisa nahi hai jiska jannat ya dozakh ka thikana tay na ho chuka ho. sahaba ne arz kya : phir kyon na ham is par bharosa kar lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke amal kartey raho kyonke har shakhs jis thikaaney ke liye paida kya gaya hai usko waisii hi taufeeq di jaeygi. jaisa ke Quran sharif ke sura واللیل mein hai) فأما من أعطى واتقى‏ ( ''jisne Allah ki raah mein khairat ki aur Allah Taala se daraa'' aakhir tak."
"6218","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (raat mein) bedaar huey aur farmaya '' Subhan-Allah ! Allah ki rehmat ke kitney khazaaney aaj nazil kiye gaey hain aur kis tarah ke fitney bhi utaarey gaey hain. kon hai! jo un hujre waaliyon ko jagaaey.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad paak beeviyon se thi taake wo Namaz padh lein kyonke bahut si duniya mein kapdey pahnney waaliyaan aakhirat mein nangii hongi aur ibne-abii-saur ne bayan kya, unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha, kya aap ne paak beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. maine kaha Allaahu-akbar."
"6219","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Safiya-bint-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas milney aaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt masjid mein Ramazan ke aakhiri Ashrey mein aetikaf kiye huey they. isha ke waqt thodi der unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baatein kiin aur wapas lotney ke liye uthein to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi unhein chhod aaney ke liye khadey ho gaey. jab wo masjid ke us darwaza ke paas pahunchein jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ka hujra tha, to idhar se 2 Ansari sahabi guzrey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya aur aagey badh gaey. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke thodi der ke liye thahar jao. ye Safiya-bint-Huyi meri biwi hain. un donon sahaba ne arz kya : sub'haan-Allaah, ya rasoolullaah. un par bada sakht guzraa. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaitan insan ke andar khoon ki tarah daudta rehta hai, isliye mujhey khof hua ke kahin wo tumharey dil mein koi shuba na daal de."
"6220","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankari phainkney se mana kya tha aur farmaya tha ke wo na shikar mar sakti hai aur na dushman ko koi nuqsan pahuncha sakti hai, albatta aankh phod sakti hai aur daant tod sakti hai."
"6221","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas 2 ashaab chheenkey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik ka jawaab یرحمک اللہ ( Allah tum par raham karey) se diya aur doosrey ka nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uski wjah poochhi gaee to farmaya ke usne الحمدللہ kaha tha (is liye iska jawab diyaa) aur doosrey ne الحمدللہ nahi kaha tha. chheenkney waley ko الحمدللہ zaroor kehna chahiye aur sunney walon ko یرحمک Allaah."
"6222","hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) baton ka hukm diya tha aur saat (7) kaamon se rokaa tha, hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bimar ki mizaaj pursi karne, janaaze ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ke jawab dene, dawat karne waley ki dawat qabool karne, salam ka jawab dene, mazloom ki madad karne aur qism kha leney waley ki qism poori karne mein madad dene ka hukm diya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) kaamon se rokaa tha, soney ki anguthi se, ya bayan kya ke soney ke chhalley se, resham aur deebaa aur sundus (deebaa se baareek reshamii kapdaa) pahnney se aur reshamii zeen se."
"6223","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( farmaya ke) Allah Taala chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamaaii ko na-pasand karta hai. isliye jab tum mein se koi shakhs chheenkey aur الحمدللہ kahey to har musalman par jo usey suney , haq hai ke iska jawaab یرحمک اللہ se de. lekin jamaaii shaitan ki taraf se hoti hai isliye jahan tak ho sakey usey rokey kyonke jab wo munh khol kar ha-ha-ha kehta hai to shaitan is par hanstaa hai."
"6224","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tum mein se koi chheenkey to (alhamdulillah) kahey aur iska bhai ya iska sathi ( rawi ko shuba tha) ( يرحمك الله ( kahey. jab sathi ( يرحمك الله ( kahey to uske jawab mein chheenkney wala ( يهديكم الله ويصلح بالكم ( .''"
"6225","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maujoodgii mein 2 aadmiyon ne chheenkaa. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein se aik ki chheenk par یرحمک اللہ kaha aur doosrey ki chheenk par nahi kaha, is par doosra shakhs bola ke ya Rasulullah ! aap ne unki chheenk par یرحمک اللہ farmaya, lekin meri chheenk par nahi farmaayaa? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhon-ne الحمدللہ kaha tha aur tum ne nahi kaha tha."
"6226","Allah Taala chheenk ko pasand karta hai kyonke wo kuchh baar sihat ki alamat hai aur jamaaii ko na-pasand karta hai. isliye jab tum mein se koi shakhs chheenkein to wo الحمدللہ kahey lekin jamaaii lena shaitan ki taraf se hota hai. isliye jab tum mein se kisi ko jamaaii aaey to wo apni quwwat w taqat ke mutabiq usey rokey. isliye ke jab tum mein se koi jamaaii leta hai to shaitan hanstaa hai."
"6227","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne Adam ko apni sura par banaya, unki lambai sath hath thi. jab unhein paida kar chuka to farmaya ke jao aur un farishton ko jo baithey huey hain, salam karo aur suno ke tumharey salam ka kya jawab detey hain, kyonke yahi tumhara aur tumhari aulad ka salam hoga. Adam (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : Assalaamualaikum ! farishton ne jawab diya, السلام علیک ورحمة الله, unhon-ne Adam ke salam par ''ورحمة الله'' badha diya. to jo shakhs bhi jannat mein jaeyga Adam (Alaihissalam) ki sura ke mutabiq ho kar jaaeyga.'' iske baad se phir khilqat ka qad w qaamat kam hota gaya, ab tak aisa hi hota raha."
"6228","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) ko qurbani ke din apni sawari par apne peechhey bithaya . wo khoobsurat gorey mard they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ko masayel bataaney ke liye khadey ho gaey. usi doran mein qabila Khasam ki aik khoobsurat aurat bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se masla poochhney aai. Fazal bhi us aurat ko dekhney lagey. uska husno-jamaal unko bhala malum hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mud kar dekha to Fazal usey dekh rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath peechhey ley ja kar Fazal ki thodii pakdi aur unka chehra dusri taraf kar diya. phir us aurat ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Haj ke barey mein Allah ka jo apne bandon par fareeza hai wo mere walid par laagu hota hai, jo bahut boodhey ho chukey hain aur sawari par seedhey nahi baith saktey. kya agar main unki taraf se Haj kar loon to unka Haj ada ho jaeyga ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, ho jaeyga"
"6229","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' raston par baithney se bacho! sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! hamari ye majaalis to bahut zaroori hain, ham wahin roz-marra guftgu kya kartey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha jab tum un majlison mein baithna hi chahtey ho to rastey ka haq ada kya karo yani rastey ko uska haq do. sahaba ne arz kya : rastey ka haq kya hai ya Rasulullah ! farmaya (ghair mehram aurton ko dekhney se) nazar neechi rakhna, raah geeron ko na sataanaa, salam ka jawab denaa, bhalai ka hukm dena aur burai se roknaa."
"6230","jab ham ( shuruaat Islam mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhtey to kehtey '' salam ho Allah par iske bandon se pahley , salam ho Jibraeel par, salam ho Mikaail par, salam ho falan par, phir (eik martaba ( jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz se farigh huey to hamari taraf mutwajjeh ho kar farmaya ke Allah hi salam hai. isliye jab tum mein se koi Namaz mein baithey to التحيات لله ، Mina والصلوات والطيبات Assalamualaik أيها النبي ورحمة الله وبركاته ، Mina السلام علينا وعلى عباد الله الصالحين padhaa kare. kyonke jab wo ye dua padheyga to aasman w zameen ke har Saleh bandey ko uski ye dua pahunchegii. أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا عبده ورسوله iske baad usey ikhtiyar hai jo dua chahey padhey ."
"6231","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''chhotaa badey ko salam karey, guzarney wala baithney waley ko salam karey aur chhoti jamat badi jamat ko pahley salam kare. ''"
"6232","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sawaar paidal chalney waley ko salam karey, paidal chalney wala baithey huey ko aur kam tadaad waley badi tadaad walon ko.''"
"6233","mujhey Ziyad ne khabar di, unhein Sabit ne khabar di jo Abdur-Rehman bin Zaid ke ghulam hain. aur unhein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' sawar paidal chalney waley ko salam karey, paidal chalney wala baithey huey shakhs ko aur chhoti jamat pahley badi jamat ko salam kare. ''"
"6234","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''chhotaa badey ko salam karey, guzarney wala baithney waley ko aur kam tadaad waley badi tadaad walon ko.''"
"6235","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) baton ka hukm diya tha. bimar ki mizaaj-pursii karne ka, janazey ke peechhey chalney ka, chheenkney waley ke jawab dene kaa. kamzor ki madad karne ka, mazloom ki madad karne ka, salam ka jawab dene aur kasrat se salam karne ka, qism ( haq ( khaney waley ki qism poori karne ka, aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ke bartan mein peeney se mana farmaya tha aur soney ki anguthi pahnney se hamein mana farmaya tha. maisar (resham ki zeen) par Sawar honey se, resham aur deebaaj pahnney, qissii (reshamii kapdaa) aur istibraq pahnney se (mana farmaya tha) ."
"6236","aik sahib ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : Islam ki kon si haalat afzal hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye ke) Allah ki makhlooq ko) khana khilaao aur salam karo, usey bhi jisey tum pehchantey ho aur usey bhi jisey nahi pehchantey ."
"6237","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi musalman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke wo apne kisi ( musalman ( bhai se teen din se zyada talluq kaatey ke jab wo milein to ye aik taraf munh pher ley aur doosra dusri taraf aur donon mein achchha wo hai jo salam pahley kare. ''aur Sufiyan ne kaha ke unhon-ne ye hadis Zohri se teen martaba suni hai."
"6238","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina Munawra ( hijrat karke ( tashrif laey to unki umr das saal thi. phir maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi ke baqi das saalon mein aap ki khidmat ki aur main parda ke hukm ke mutaalliq sabse zyada janta hun ke Kab nazil hua tha. Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) mujh se iske barey mein puchha kartey they. parda ke hukm ka nuzool sabse pahley us raat hua jis main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) se nikah ke baad unke sath pehli raat guzari thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke dulhaa they aur aap ne sahaba ko dawat walima par bulaya tha. khaney se farigh ho kar sab log chaley gaey lekin chand aadmi aap ke paas baithey reh gaey aur bahut der tak wahin thahrey rahe. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uth kar bahar tashrif le gaey aur main bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chala gaya taake wo log bhi chaley jaaein. Nabi Karim chaltey rahe aur main bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chalta raha aur samjha ke wo log ab chaley gaey hain. isliye wapas tashrif laey aur main bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath wapas aaya lekin aap jab Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ke hujrey mein dakhil huey to wo log abhi baithey huey they aur abhi tak wapas nahi gaey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dobara wahan se lot gaey aur main bhi aap ke sath lot gaya. jab aap Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre ki chaukhat tak pahunchey to aap ne samjha ke wo log nikal chukey hongey. phir aap lot kar aaey aur main bhi aap ke sath lot aaya to waqei wo log ja chukey they. phir parde ki aayat nazil hui aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere aur apne darmyan parda latkaa liya."
"6239","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zenab (Raziallahu anha) se nikah kya to log andar aaey aur khana khaya phir baith ke baatein kartey rahe. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is tarah izhar kya maano aap khadey hona chahtey hain. lekin wo khadey nahi huey jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye dekha to khadey ho gaey. aap ke khadey honey par qaum ke jin logon ko khada hona tha wo bhi khadey ho gaey lekin kuchh log ab bhi baithey rahe aur jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar dakhil honey ke liye tashrif laey to kuchh log baithey huey they (aap wapas ho gaey (aur phir jab wo log bhi khadey huey aur chaley gaey to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski itlaa di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur andar dakhil ho gaey. maine bhi andar jana chaha lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere aur apne darmyan parda daal liya aur Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki يا أيها الذين آمنوا لا تدخلوا بيوت النبي ''aey eman waalo! Nabi ke ghar mein na dakhil ho.'' aakhir tak."
"6240","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha kartey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) paak beeviyon ka parda karaaein. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa nahi kya aur paak beeviyan zarurat se farigh honey ke liye sirf raat hi ke waqt nikalti thin (us waqt gharon mein baitul-khala nahi they) aik martaba Sauda-binte-Zama (Raziallahu anhu) bahar gaee hui thin. unka qad lamba tha. Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein dekha. us waqt wo majlis mein baithey huey they. unhon-ne kaha Sauda maine aapko pehchan liya ye unhon-ne isliye kaha kyonke wo parda ke hukm nazil honey ke badey mutmannii they. bayan kya ke phir Allah Taala ne parde ki aayat nazil ki."
"6241","aik shakhs ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kisi hujre mein suraakh se dekha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas us waqt aik kangha tha jis se aap sar Mubarak khujaa rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke agar mujhey malum hota ke tum jhank rahe ho to ye kangha tumhari aankh mein chubho deta (andar dakhil honey se pahley) ijazat maangna to hai hi isliye ke (andar ki koi zaatii cheez) na dekhi jaey."
"6242","aik sahib Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kisi hujre mein jhank kar dekhney lagey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki taraf teer ka phal ya bahut se phal lekar badhey, maano main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun un sahib ki taraf is tarah chupkey-chupkey tashrif laey."
"6243","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis se zyada sagheera gunahon se mushabeh (similar) maine aur koi cheez nahi dekhi. (abu-Huraira (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo baatein bayan ki hain wo murad hain) mujh se Mehmood ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Abdur-Razzaq ne khabar di, kaha ham ko Mamar ne khabar di, unhein ibne- Taaus ne, unhein unke walid ne aur unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke maine koi cheez sagheera gunahon se mushabeh (similar) is hadis ke muqable mein nahi dekhi jisey Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kya hai ke Allah Taala ne insanon ke maamle mein zina mein se iska hissey likh diya hai jis se wo laa-muhaalaa do-chaar hoga to aankh ka zina dekhnaa hai, zaban ka zina bolnaa hai, dil ka zina ye hai ke wo khahish aur aarzoo karta hai phir sharmgah us khahish ko sachcha karti hai ya jhutlaa deti hai."
"6244","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kisi ko salam kartey (aur jawab na miltaa) to teen martaba salam kartey they aur jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) koi baat farmatey to (zyaada se zyaada) teen martaba usey dohraatey."
"6245","mein Ansar ki aik majlis mein tha ke abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif laey jaisey ghabraaey huey hon. unhon-ne kaha ke maine umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan teen martaba andar aaney ki ijazat chahi lekin mujhey koi jawab nahi mila, isliye wapas chala aaya ( umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko malum hua) to unhon-ne malum kya ke (andar aaney mein) kya baat rukawat thi? maine kaha ke maine teen martaba andar aaney ki ijazat mangi aur jab mujhey koi jawab nahi mila to wapas chala gaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke jab tum mein se koi kisi se teen martaba ijazat chahey aur ijazat na miley to wapas chala jana chahiye umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! tumhen is hadis ki sihat ke liye koi gawah lana hoga. ( abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne majlis walon se puchha ( kya tum mein koi aisa hai jisne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis suni ho? Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qism ! tumharey sath ( uski gawahi dene ke siwa ( jamat mein sabse kam Umr shakhs ke koi aur nahi khada hoga. abu-Saeed ne kaha aur main hi jamat ka wo sabse kam Umr aadmi tha mein unke sath uth khada ho gaya aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke waqei Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa farmaya hai. aur ibne-Mubarak ne bayan kya ke mujh ko Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne khabar di, kaha mujh se Yazeed bin khaseefa ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Basar-bin-Saeed se, kaha maine abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se suna phir yahi hadis naql ki."
"6246","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (aap ke ghar mein) dakhil hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik badey pyaley mein doodh paya to farmaya '' Abu-Hurera ! ahal suffa ke paas ja aur unhein mere paas bula laa. main unke paas aaya aur unhein bula laya. wo aaey aur (andar aaney ki) ijazat chahi phir jab ijazat di gaee to dakhil huey. ''"
"6247","aap bachchon ke paas se guzrey to unhein salam kya aur farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi aisa hi kartey they."
"6248","ham Juma ke din khush hua kartey they. maine kaha kis liye? farmaya ke hamari aik budhiyaa thin jo maqam bizaa' jaya karti thin. ibne-Salma ne kaha ke Bizaa' Madina Munawra ka khajoor ka aik baagh tha. phir wo wahan se chuqandar laya karti thin aur usey handi mein dalti thin aur jau ke kuchh daney pees kar (is mein milaatii thiin) jab ham Juma ki Namaz padh kar wapas hotey to unhein salam karne aatey aur wo ye chuqandar ki jad mein aata mili hui dawat hamarey samney rakhti thin ham us wjah se Juma ke din khush hua kartey they aur qailula ya do-pahar ka khana ham Juma ke baad kartey they."
"6249","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Aaisha! ye Jibraeel hain tumhen salam kehtey hain bayan kya ke maine arz kya وعليه السلام ورحمة الله aap dekhtey hain jo ham nahi dekh saktey Ummul-Momenin ka ishara Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf tha. Mamar ke sath us hadis ko Shuaib aur Yunus aur Nauman ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya hai Yunus aur Nauman ki riwayaton main ( وبركاته‏ .) ka lafz zyada hai."
"6250","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein us qarz ke barey mein hazir hua jo mere walid par tha. maine darwaza khatkhataayaa . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kon hain? maine kaha ''main '' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' main, main '' jaisey aap ne us jawab ko na-pasand farmaya,"
"6251","aik shakhs masjid mein dakhil hua, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid ke kinarey baithey huey they. us ne Namaz padhi aur phir hazir ho kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya wa'lekassalaam wapas ja aur dobara Namaz padh , kyonke tum ne Namaz nahi padhi. wo wapas gaey aur Namaz padhi. phir (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ke paas aaey aur salam kya aap ne farmaya wa'lekassalaam. wapas jao phir Namaz padho . kyonke tum ne Namaz nahi padhi. wo wapas gaya aur us ne phir Namaz padhi. phir wapas aaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein salam arz kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab mein farmaya wa'laikassalaam. wapas jao aur dobara Namaz padho . kyonke tum ne Namaz nahi padhi. un sahib ne dusri martaba , ya iske ba'd, arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mujhey Namaz padhni sikhaa dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab Namaz ke liye khadey hua karo to pahley poori tarah wuzu kya karo, phir qibley ki taraf ho kar takbeer ( takbeer tahreema ( kaho , iske baad Quran Majeed mein se jo tumharey liye aasan ho wo padho, phir rukoo karo aur jab rukoo ki haalat mein barabar ho jao to sar uthaao. jab seedhey khadey ho jao to phir sajde mein jao, jab sajda poori tarah kar lo to sar uthao aur achi tarah se baith jao phir sajde mein jao, jab sajda poori tarah kar lo to sar uthao aur achi tarah se baith jao. yahi amal apni har rakaat mein karo aur abu-Usama (raawii) ne baad yun kaha ke phir utho yahan tak ke saiyed hai khada ho jao ."
"6252","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' phir sar sajde se utha aur achi tarah baith jaa. ''"
"6253","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) tumhen salam kehtey hain. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke w-alaihissalaam warahmatullaah un par bhi Allah ki taraf se salamati aur uski rehmat nazil ho."
"6254","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik gadhey par Sawar huey jis par paalaan bandhaa hua tha aur nichey fidak ki bani hui aik makhmalii chadar bichhi hui thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sawari par apne peechhey Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ko bithaya tha. aap bani Haris bin khazraj mein Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif ley ja rahe they. ye jange-badr se pahley ka waqia hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik majlis par se guzrey jis mein musalmaan, but parast, mushrik aur Yahudi sab hi Sharik they. Abdullah-bin-Ubai ibne-Salool bhi unmein tha. majlis mein Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha bhi maujood they. jab majlis par sawari ki gard padi to Abdullah ne apni chadar se apni naak chipa li aur kaha ke hamarey uper ghubaar na udaao . phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam kya aur wahan ruk gaey aur utar kar unhein Allah ki taraf bulaya aur unke liye Quran Majeed ki tilawat ki. Abdullah-bin-Ubai ibne-Salool bola, miyan ye baatein meri samajh mein nahiin aatiin agar wo cheez haq hai jo tum kehtey ho to hamari majlison mein aa kar hamein takleef na diya karo. is par ibne- Rawaha ne kaha ya Rasulullah ! aap hamari majlison mein tashrif laya karein kyonke ham usey pasand kartey hain. phir muslmaanon, mushrikon aur yahudiyon mein is baat par tu-tu main-main honey lagi aur qareeb tha ke wo koi irada kar baithein aur aik doosrey par hamla kar dein. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein barabar khamosh karatey rahe aur jab wo khamosh ho gaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawari par baith kar Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya, Sad tum ne nahi suna ke abu-Hubaab ne aaj kya baat kahi hai. aap ka ishara Abdullah-bin-Ubai ki taraf tha ke usne ye ye baatein kahi hain. Sad ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! usey maaf kar dijiye aur darguzar farmaiye. Allah Taala ne wo haq aapko ata farmaya hai jo ata farmana tha. us basti (Madina munawwara) ke log (aap ki tashrif aawrii se pahley) is par muttafiq ho gaey they ke usey taaj pehna dein aur shahi amama uske sar par baandh dein lekin jab Allah Taala ne us mansubey ko us haq ki wjah se khatm kar diya jo usney aapko ata farmaya hai to usey haq se hasad ho gaya aur usi wjah se us ne ye mamla kya hai jo aap ne dekha. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey maaf kar diya."
"6255","jab wo jange-Tabook mein Sharik nahi ho sakey they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se baat-cheet karne ki manaahii kar di thi aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar salam karta tha aur ye andaza lagata tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab salam mein hont Mubarak hilaaey ya nahi, aakhir pachaas din guzar gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki bargah mein hamari tauba ke qabool kiye janey ka namaze-Fajr ke baad elaan kya."
"6256","kuchh Yahudi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha ke) السام عليك‏) ( tumhen maut aaey ( mein unki baat samajh gaee aur maine jawab diya ( عليكم السام واللعنة‏ . Mina ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Aaisha sabr se kaam ley kyonke Allah Taala tamam maamlaat mein narmii ko pasand karta hai, maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya aap ne nahi suna ke unhon-ne kya kaha tha? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine unko jawab de diya tha ke) Waalekum ( (aur tumhen bhi) ."
"6257","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab tumhen Yahudi salam karein aur agar unmein se koi ( السام عليك‏ . Mina ( kahey to tum iske jawab mein sirf ( وعليك ( (aur tumhen bhi) keh diya karo."
"6258","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab ahle-kitab tumhen salam karein to tum iske jawab mein sirf ( Waalekum ( kaho. ''"
"6259","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Zubair-bin-Awaam aur Abu-Marsad ghanwii ko bhejaa. ham sab ghud sawar they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jao aur jab rauza khaakh (Makka aur Madina ke darmyan aik maqam ( par pahuncho to wahan tumhen mushrekeen ki aik aurat milegii uske paas Haatib bin abi Balta' ka aik khat hai jo mushrekeen ke paas bheja gaya hai (usey ley aao). bayan kya ke ham ne us aurat ko pa liya wo apne oont par ja rahi thi aur wahin par mili (jahaan) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bataya tha. bayan kya ke ham ne us se kaha ke khat jo tum sath ley ja rahi ho wo kahan hai? usne kaha ke mere paas koi khat nahi hai. ham ne iske oont ko bithaya aur uske kajaawe mein talashi li lekin hamein koi cheez nahi milii. mere donon sathiyon ne kaha ke hamein koi khat to nazar aata nahi. bayan kya ke maine kaha, mujhey yaqin hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghalat baat nahi kahi hai. qism hai uski jiski qism khaaii jati hai, tum khat nikaalo warna main tumhen nangaa kar doonga . bayan kya ke jab us aurat ne dekha ke main waqei us maamle mein sanjeeda hun to usne izaar baandhney ki jagah ki taraf hath badhaayaa, wo aik chadar izaar ke taur par baandhey huey thi aur khat nikaalaa. bayan kya ke ham usey lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke Haatib tum ne aisa kyon kya? unhon-ne kaha ke main ab bhi Allah aur uske rasool par eman rakhta hun. mere andar koi badlaaw w tabdili nahi aai hai, mera maqsad ( khat bhejney se) sirf ye tha ke) Quraish par aap ki fauj kashii ki itlaa dun aur us tarah) mera un logon par ehsan ho jaey aur uski wjah se Allah mere ahal aur maal ki taraf se ( unse ( mudaafiat karaaey. aap ke jitney muhajir sahaba hain unke Makka Mukarrama mein aisey afraad hain jinke zariey Allah unke maal aur unke ghar walon ki hifazat karaaeyga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhon-ne sach keh diya hai ab tum log unke barey mein siwa bhalai ke aur kuchh na kaho bayan kya ke is par umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke us shakhs ne Allah aur uske rasool aur mominon ke sath khayanat ki, mujhey ijazat dijiye ke main uski gardan mar dun bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : umr ! tumhen kya ma'loom, Allah Taala badr ki ladai mein Sharik sahaba ki zindagi par muttla tha aur uske bawajud farmaya ke tum jo chaho karo, tumharey liye jannat likh di gaee hai, bayan kya ke is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki aankhon mein aansu aagey aur arz kya : Allah aur uske rasool hi zyada jaanney waley hain."
"6260","Hiraql ne Quraish ke chand afraad ke sath unhein bhi bula bheja ye log Sham (Syria) tijarat ki gharaz se gaey they sab log Hiraql ke paas aaey phir unhon-ne waqia bayan kya ke phir Hiraql ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khat mangwaya aur wo padha gaya khat mein ye likha hua thaa. bismillaahir-rahmaanir-raheem, Muhammad ki taraf se jo Allah ka banda aur uska rasool hai (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) . Hiraql azeem Rome (mojooda Itly) ki taraf, salam ho un par jinhoney hidayat ki ittaba (pairvi) ki. ammaa ba'd!"
"6261","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani-Israeel ke aik shakhs ka zikr kya ke unhon-ne lakdi ka aik latthaa liya aur is mein suraakh karke aik hazaar Dinar aur khat rakh diya wo unki taraf se unke sathi ( qarz-khaah ( ki taraf tha aur Umar-bin abi Salma ne bayan kya ke unse unke walid ne aur unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhon-ne lakdi ke aik latthey mein suraakh kya aur maal iske andar rakh diya aur unke paas aik khat likha , falan ki taraf se falan ko miley."
"6262","Qureza ke Yahudi Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ko saalis banaaney par taiyaar ho gaey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bula bheja jab wo aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne sardaar ke leney ko utho ya yun farmaya ke apne mein sabse behtar ko leney ke liye utho. phir wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baith gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bani Qureza ke log tumharey faisley par razi ho kar) qil'a se) utar aaey hain ( ab tum kya faisla kartey ho ( . Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir main ye faisla karta hun ke unmein jo jang ke qaabil hain unhein qatl kar diya jaey aur unke bachchon aur aurton ko qaid kar liya jaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aap ne wahi faisla farmaya jis faisla ko farishta lekar aaya tha. abu-Adbullah ( musannif ( ne bayan kya ke mujhey mere kuchh ashaab ne abul-Waleed ke waaste se abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ka qaul ( alii (ke bajaey بصلہ ( إلى حكمك‏ . Mina ( naql kya hai."
"6263","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, kya musaafa ka dastoor Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein tha? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan zaroor tha."
"6264","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka hath pakdey huey they."
"6265","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey tashahud sikhaayaa, us waqt mera hath Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheliyon ke darmyan mein tha (is tarah sikhaayaa) jis tarah aap Quran ki sura sikhaya kartey they. التحيات لله والصلوات والطيبات ، Mina Assalamualaik أيها النبي ورحمة الله وبركاته ، Mina السلام علينا وعلى عباد الله الصالحين ، Mina أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا عبده ورسوله nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt hayaat they. jab aap ki wafat ho gaee to ham ( Khattab ka seegha ke bajaey) is tarah padhney lagey السلام‏ . Mina على النبي yaanii Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par salam ho."
"6266","Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) (marzul-maut mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se nikley (doosri sanad) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha aur ham se Ahmed bin Saleh ne bayan kya, kaha ham se anbasaa bin Khalid ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Yunus bin Yazeed ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Shahab Zohri ne bayan kya, kaha mujh ko Abdullah-bin Kab-bin-Malik ne khabar di aur unhein Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan se nikley, ye us marz ka waqia hai jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui thi. logon ne puchha : aey abul-Hasan! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne subah kaisi guzaarii? unhon-ne kaha ke bihamdillaah aapko sukoon raha hai. phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ka hath Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne pakad kar kaha, kya tum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhtey nahi ho. ( Allah ki qism ( teen din ke baad tumhen laathii ka banda bannaa padega. Allah ki qism main samajhta hun ke is marz mein aap wafat pa jaengey. main bani abdul-Muttalib ke chehron par maut ke aasaar ko khub pehchanta hun, isliye hamarey sath tum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas chalo. taake puchha jaey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad khilafat kis ke hath mein rahegi agar wo hamiin logon ko miltii hai to hamein malum ho jaeyga aur agar dusron ke paas jaeygi to ham arz karengey taake Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey barey mein kuchh wasiiyat karein. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! agar ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khilafat ki darkhaast ki aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne inkar kar diya to phir log hamein kabhi nahi dengey main to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kabhi nahi poochhunga ke aap ke baad kon khaleefa ho."
"6267","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey sawar tha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Muaz ! maine kaha ( لبيك وسعديك‏ . Mina ( ) hazir hun) . phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen martaba mujhey isi tarah mukhaatab kya iske baad farmaya tumhen malum hai ke bandon par Allah ka kya haq hai? (phir khud hi jawab diyaa) ye ke usi ki ibadat karein aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik na thehraein phir aap thodi der chaltey rahe aur farmaya ke aey Muaaz! maine kaha ( لبيك وسعديك‏ ( farmaya tumhen malum hai ke jab wo ye kar lein to Allah par bandon ka kya haq hai? ye ke unhein azab na de."
"6268","(kaha ke) Allah ki qism ham se Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne maqam Rabza mein bayan kya ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath raat ke waqt Madina Munawra ki kali pattharon wali zameen par chal raha tha ke Uhud pahaad dikhai diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey abu-Zar! mujhey pasand nahi ke agar Uhud pahaad ke barabar bhi mere paas sona ho aur mujh par aik raat bhi is tarah guzar jaey ya teen raat ke usmein se aik Dinar bhi mere paas baqi bachey. siwaey iske jo main qarz ki adaaeygi ke liye mehfooz rakh loon main us sarey soney ko Allah ki makhlooq mein is-is tarah taqseem kar doonga. Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne uski kaifiyat hamein apne hath se lap bhar kar dikhaaii. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Abu-Zar ! maine arz kya ( لبيك وسعديك‏ . Mina (ya Rasulullah! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke zyada jama karne waley hi (sawab ki haisiyat se) kam hasil karne waley hongey. siwaey iske jo Allah ke bandon par maal is-is tarah yani kasarat ke sath kharch kare. phir farmaya yahin thahrey raho abu-Zar! yahan se us waqt tak na hatna jab tak mein wapas na aa jaun. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif le gaey aur nazron se ojhal ho gaey. iske baad maine awaz suni aur mujhey khatrah hua ke kahin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko koi pareshani na pesh aa gaee ho. isliye maine (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhney ke liye) jana chaha lekin fauran hi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye irshad yad aaya ke yahan se na hatnaa. chunanche main wahin ruk gaya (jab aap tashrif laey to ( maine arz ki. maine awaz suni thi aur mujhey khatrah ho gaya tha ke kahin aapko koi pareshani na pesh aa jaey phir mujhey aap ka irshad yad aaya isliye main yahin thahar gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) they. mere paas aaey they aur mujhey khabar di hai ke meri ummat ka jo shakhs bhi is haal mein marega ke Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko Sharik na thahraataa ho to wo jannat mein jaeyga maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! bhale hi usne zina aur chori ki ho? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, agar us ne zina aur chori bhi ki ho. (Aamash ne bayan kya ke) maine Zaid-bin Wahab se kaha ke mujhey malum hua hai ke is hadis ke rawi abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) hain? Zaid ne farmaya main gawahi deta hun ke ye hadis mujh se Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne maqam Rabza mein bayan ki thi. Aamash ne bayan kya ke mujh se Abu-Saleh ne hadis bayan ki aur unse abu darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi tarah bayan kya aur abu-shahaab ne Aamash se bayan kya."
"6269","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs kisi doosrey shakhs ko iske baithney ki jagah se na uthaey ke khud wahan baith jaaey.''"
"6270","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is se mana farmaya tha ke kisi shakhs ko uski jagah se uthaya jaey taake doosra uski jagah par baithey, albatta ( aaney waley ko majlis mein) jagah de diya karo aur faraakhii kar diya karo aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) na-pasand kartey they ke koi shakhs majlis mein se kisi ko utha kar khud uski jagah baith jaey."
"6271","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) se nikah kya to logon ko) dawat walima par) bulaya. logon ne khana khaya phir baith kar baatein kartey rahe bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa kya maano aap uthna chahtey hain. lekin log ( phir bhi baithey huey they) phir bhi khadey nahi huey. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye dekha to aap khadey ho gaey jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey to aap ke sath aur bhi bahut se sahaba khadey ho gaey lekin teen aadmi ab bhi baqi reh gaey. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar janey ke liye tashrif laey lekin wo log ab bhi baithey huey they. iske baad wo log bhi chaley gaey. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir main aaya aur maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko itlaa di ke wo ( teen aadmi ( bhi ja chukey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur andar dakhil ho gaey. maine bhi andar jana chaha lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere aur apne darmyan parda daal liya aur Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki يا أيها الذين آمنوا لا تدخلوا بيوت النبي إلا أن يؤذن لكم aey eman waalo! Nabi ke ghar mein us waqt tak dakhil na ho jab tak tumhen ijazat na di jaaey.'' irshad hua إن ذلكم كان عند الله عظيما tak."
"6272","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sehan Kaba mein dekha ke aap peeth ke bal baithey huey donon raanein pet se milaaey huey hathon se pindlii pakdey huey baithey they."
"6273","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kya main tumhen sabse badey gunah ki khabar na dun. '' sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya kyon nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke sath shirk karna aur waalidain ki nafarmani karnaa."""
"6274","(aur ye bhi bayan kya ke) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tek lagaey huey they phir aap seedhey baith gaey aur farmaya '' haan aur jhooti baat bhii. '' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey itni martaba baar-baar dohraatey rahe ke ham ne kaha, kash! aap khamosh ho jatey."
"6275","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Asr ki Namaz padhai aur phir badi tezi ke sath chal kar aap ghar mein dakhil ho gaey."
"6276","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takht ke beech mein Namaz padhtey they aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur qible ke darmyan leti rehti thi mujhey koi zarurat hoti lekin mujh ko khadey ho kar aap ke samney aana bura malum hota. albatta aap ki taraf rukh karke main aahista se khisak jati thi."
"6277","main tumharey walid Zaid ke sath Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, unhon-ne ham se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mere rozey ka zikr kya gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey maine aap ke liye chamdey ka aik gaddaa, jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi bichhaa diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zameen par baithey aur gaddaa mere aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darmyan waisaa hi padaa raha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke kya tumharey liye har mahiney mein teen din ke) rozey ( kafi nahi ? maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya phir panch din rakha kar. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! farmaya saat (7) din . maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! farmaya nau (9) din . maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! farmaya gyara (11) din . maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! farmaya Dawud (Alaihissalam) ke rozey se zyada koi roza nahi hai. zindagi ke aadhey din, aik din ka roza aur aik din baghair roza ke rehna."
"6278","aap mulk Sham (Syria) mein pahunchey (doosri sanad) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke aur mujh se abul-Waleed ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Mughira ne aur unse Ibrahim ne bayan kya ke Alqama mulk Sham (Syria) gaey aur masjid mein ja kar do rakaat Namaz padhi phir ye dua ki aey Allaah! mujhey aik sathi ata farmaa. chunanche wo abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ki majlis mein ja baithey. abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne malum kya. tumhara talluq kahan se hai? kaha ke ahale-koofa se, puchha kya tumharey yahan (nifaaq aur munaafeqeen ke) bhedon ke jaanney waley wo sahabi nahi hain jinke siwa koi aur unko janta nahi hai? unka ishara Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf tha. kya tumharey yahan wo nahi hain (ya yun kaha ke) tumharey wo jinhein Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zabani shaitan se panah di thi? ishara Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf tha. kya tumharey yahan miswak aur gaddey waley nahi hain? unka ishara ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf tha. Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sura ( والليل إذا يغشى‏ ( kis tarah padhtey they. Alqama (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wo ( والذكر والأنثى‏ ( padhtey they. abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke ye log Kufa waley apne musalsal amal se qareeb tha ke mujhey shubeh mein daal detey halanke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khud usey suna tha."
"6279","ham khana aur qailula Namaz Juma ke baad kya kartey they."
"6280","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko koi naam abu-Turaab se zyada mahboob nahi tha. jab unko us naam se bulaya jata to wo khush hotey they. aik martaba Rasulullah (sl), Fatima (Alaihissalam) ke ghar tashrif laey to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko ghar mein nahi paya to farmaya ke beti tumharey chacha ke ladkey (aur shauhar) kahan gaey hain? unhon-ne kaha mere aur unke darmyan kuchh talkh kalaamii ho gaee thi wo mujh par ghussa ho kar bahar chaley gaey aur mere yahan ( ghar mein) qailula nahi kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs se kaha ke dekho wo kahan hain. wo sahabi wapas aaey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! wo to masjid mein soey huey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein tashrif laey to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) letey huey they aur chadar aap ke pahlu se gir gaee thi aur gard mein ho gaee thi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se mitti saaf karne lagey aur farmaney lagey, abu-Turaab! (mittii waale) utho, abu-Turaab! utho."
"6281","(unki waalida) Umme-Sulaim, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye chamdey ka farsh bichhaa deti thin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke yahan usi par qailula kar letey they. bayan kya phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey (aur bedaar huey) to Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka paseena aur (jhadey huey) aap ke baal ley liye aur (paseena ko) aik sheeshii mein jama kya aur phir ( سك ( (eik khushboo) mein usey mila liya. bayan kya hai ke phir jab Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki wafat ka waqt qareeb hua to unhon-ne wasiiyat ki ke us ( سك ( (jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka paseena mila hua tha) mein se unke Hanoot mein mila diya jaey. bayan kya hai ke phir unke Hanoot mein usey milaya gaya."
"6282","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quba tashrif ley jatey they, to umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar bhi jatey they aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khana khilaatii thin phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur bedaar huey to aap hans rahe they. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke rastey mein jang kartey huey mere samney ( khuwab mein) pesh kiye gaey, jo us samandar ke uper (kashtiyon mein) sawar hongey ( jannat mein wo aisey nazar aaey ( jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain, ya bayan kya ke baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. Ishaq ko un lafzon mein zara shuba tha (umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! dua karein ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se banaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar rakh kar so gaey aur jab bedaar huey to hans rahe they. maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke raaste mein jang kartey huey mere samney pesh kiye gaey jo us samandar ke uper sawar hongey jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain ya baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. maine arz kya ke Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to us giroh ke sabse pahley logon mein hogi chunanche umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki Sham (Syria) par governary ke zamane mein) samandari safar kya aur khushkii par utarney ke baad apni sawari se gir padiin aur wafat pa gain ."
"6283","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quba tashrif ley jatey they, to umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar bhi jatey they aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khana khilaatii thin phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur bedaar huey to aap hans rahe they. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke rastey mein jang kartey huey mere samney ( khuwab mein) pesh kiye gaey, jo us samandar ke uper (kashtiyon mein) sawar hongey ( jannat mein wo aisey nazar aaey ( jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain, ya bayan kya ke baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. Ishaq ko un lafzon mein zara shuba tha (umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! dua karein ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se banaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar rakh kar so gaey aur jab bedaar huey to hans rahe they. maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke raaste mein jang kartey huey mere samney pesh kiye gaey jo us samandar ke uper sawar hongey jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain ya baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. maine arz kya ke Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to us giroh ke sabse pahley logon mein hogi chunanche umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki Sham (Syria) par governary ke zamane mein) samandari safar kya aur khushkii par utarney ke baad apni sawari se gir padiin aur wafat pa gain ."
"6284","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 tarah ke pahnaawey se aur 2 tarah ki khareed w farokht se mana farmaya tha. ishtimaale-Sammaa (ek chadar ko is tarah lapetna ki jism ka ek hissey khula reh jaaye) aur aik kapdey mein is tarah ehtibaa karne se ke insan ki sharmgah par koi cheez na ho aur mulaamisat aur munaabizat se. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Mamar , Muhammad-bin abi Hafsa aur Abdullah-bin Budail ne Zohri se ki hai."
"6285","ye tamam paak beeviyon (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wafat k marz mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas thin, koi wahan se nahi hata tha ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) chaltii hui aaein. Allah ki qasam! unki chaal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chaal se alag nahi thi ( balke bahut hi mushabeh (similar) thi) jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to khush aamadeed kaha, farmaya beti ! marhaba ! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni daain taraf ya baain taraf unhein bithaya . iske baad aahista se unse kuchh kaha aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) bahut zyada roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka gham dekha to dobara unse sargoshi ki is par wo hansney lagiin. tamam beeviyon mein se maine unse kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham mein sirf aapko sargoshi ki khusoosiyat bakhshii. phir aap roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey to maine unse puchha ke aap ke kaan mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya tha unhon-ne kaha ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz nahi khol saktii. phir jab aap ki wafat ho gaee to maine Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke mera jo haq aap par hai iska waasta deti hun ke aap mujhey wo baat bata dein. unhon-ne kaha ke ab bata sakti hun, chunanche unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se pehli sargoshi ki thi to farmaya tha ke '' Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) har saal mujh se saal mein aik martaba daur kya kartey they lekin is saal mujh se unhon-ne 2 martaba daur kya aur mera khayal hai ke meri wafat ka waqt qareeb hai, Allah se dartii rehna aur sabr karna kyonke main tumharey liye aik achchha aagey janey wala hun '' bayan kya ke us waqt mera ronaa jo aap ne dekha tha uski wjah yahi thi. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri pareshani dekhi to aap ne dobara mujh se sargoshi ki, farmaya ''Faatima betii! kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke jannat main tum mominon ki aurton ki sardaar hogi, ya (farmaayaa ke) is ummat ki aurton ki sardaar hogii.''"
"6286","ye tamam paak beeviyon (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wafat k marz mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas thin, koi wahan se nahi hata tha ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) chaltii hui aaein. Allah ki qasam! unki chaal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chaal se alag nahi thi ( balke bahut hi mushabeh (similar) thi) jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to khush aamadeed kaha, farmaya beti ! marhaba ! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni daain taraf ya baain taraf unhein bithaya . iske baad aahista se unse kuchh kaha aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) bahut zyada roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka gham dekha to dobara unse sargoshi ki is par wo hansney lagiin. tamam beeviyon mein se maine unse kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham mein sirf aapko sargoshi ki khusoosiyat bakhshii. phir aap roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey to maine unse puchha ke aap ke kaan mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya tha unhon-ne kaha ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz nahi khol saktii. phir jab aap ki wafat ho gaee to maine Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke mera jo haq aap par hai iska waasta deti hun ke aap mujhey wo baat bata dein. unhon-ne kaha ke ab bata sakti hun, chunanche unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se pehli sargoshi ki thi to farmaya tha ke '' Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) har saal mujh se saal mein aik martaba daur kya kartey they lekin is saal mujh se unhon-ne 2 martaba daur kya aur mera khayal hai ke meri wafat ka waqt qareeb hai, Allah se dartii rehna aur sabr karna kyonke main tumharey liye aik achchha aagey janey wala hun '' bayan kya ke us waqt mera ronaa jo aap ne dekha tha uski wjah yahi thi. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri pareshani dekhi to aap ne dobara mujh se sargoshi ki, farmaya ''Faatima betii! kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke jannat main tum mominon ki aurton ki sardaar hogi, ya (farmaayaa ke) is ummat ki aurton ki sardaar hogii.''"
"6287","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid mein chit letey dekha aap aik paon doosrey par rakhey huey they."
"6288","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab teen aadmi sath hon to teesrey sathi ko chhod kar do aapas mein kaana phoosii (sargoshi) na karein.''"
"6289","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se aik raaz ki baat kahi thi aur maine wo raaz kisi ko nahi bataya (unki walida ( Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi mujh se iske mutaalliq puchha lekin maine unhein bhi nahi bataya."
"6290","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab teen aadmi hon to teesrey sathi ko chhod kar tum aapas mein kaana phoosii (sargoshi) na kya karo. isliye ke logon ko ranj hoga albatta agar doosrey aadmi bhi hon to muzaayqa nahi.''"
"6291","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba kuchh maal taqseem farmaya is par Ansar ke aik shakhs ne kaha ke ye aisi taqseem hai jis se Allah ki khushnoodii maqsud na thi maine kaha ke haan! Allah ki qism main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein jaaunga. chunanche main gaya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt majlis mein baithey huey they maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kaan mein chupkey se ye baat kahi to aap ghussa ho gaey aur aap ka chehra surkh ho gaya phir aap ne farmaya ke Musa (Alaihissalam) par Allah ki rehmat ho unhein us se bhi zyada takleef pahunchai gaee lekin unhon-ne sabr kya (isliye main bhi sabr karunga) ."
"6292","Namaz ki takbeer kahi gaee aur aik sahabi rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sargoshi kartey rahe, phir wo der tak sargoshi kartey rahe yahan tak ke aap ke sahaba soney lagey iske baad aap uthey aur Namaz padhai."
"6293","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab soney lago to ghar mein aag na chhodo.''"
"6294","Madina Munawra mein aik ghar raat ke waqt jal gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq kaha gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aag tumhari dushman hai is liye jab soney lago to usey bujhaa diya karo."
"6295","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(sotey waqt) bartan dhak liya karo warna darwazey band kar liya karo aur charagh bujhaa liya karo kyonke ye choohaa kabhi-kabhi charagh ki battii kheench leta hai aur ghar walon ko jalaa deta hai.''"
"6296","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab raat mein soney lago to charagh bujhaa diya karo aur darwazey band kar liya karo aur mishkezon ka munh baandh diya karo aur khaney peeney ki cheezein dhak diya karo. Hammad ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke ye bhi farmaya ke '' bhale hi aik lakdi se ho.''"
"6297","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''paanch cheezein fitrat se hain, khatna karnaa, naaf ke nichey ke baal banaanaa, baghl ke baal saaf karnaa, moonchh chhoti karaanaa aur naakhun kaatna .''"
"6298","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Ibraaheem (Alaihissalam) ne assii ( 80 ( saal ki umr mein khatna karaya aur aap ne ( qudoom Mina . Mina ( ) kami ke saath) ( kulhaadii ( se khatna kya. ''ham se Quteba ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Mughira ne bayan kya aur unse abu-Zinaad ne ( بالقدوم‏‏ . Mina ( ) tashdeed ke sath bayan kya ( ."
"6299","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha gaya ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to aap ki umr kya thi? kaha ke un dinon mera khatna ho chuka tha aur Arab logon ki aadat thi jab tak ladka jawaanii ke qareeb na hota uska khatna na kartey they."
"6300","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to mera khatna ho chuka tha."
"6301","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se jisne qism khaaii aur kaha ke laat w uzzaa ki qism , to phir wo ( لا إله إلا الله ( kahey aur jisne apne sathi se kaha ke aao juwa khelein to usey sadqa kar dena chahiye ''"
"6302","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane main apne hathon se aik ghar banaya taake barish se hifazat rahe aur dhoop se saaya hasil ho. Allah ki makhlooq mein se kisi ne us kaam mein meri madad nahi ki. malum hua ke zarurat ke laaiq ghar banaanaa durust hai."
"6303","Allah ki qism Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad na maine koi iint kisi iint par rakhi aur na koi baagh lagaya. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke jab maine iska zikr ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke kuchh gharaanon ke samney kya to unhon-ne kaha ke Allah ki qism unhon-ne ghar banaya tha. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine kaha phir ye baat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ghar banaaney se pahley kahi hogi."
"6304","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har Nabi ko aik dua hasil hoti hai (jo qabool ki jati hai) aur main chahta hun ke main apni dua ko aakhirat main apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye mehfooz rakhoon.''"
"6305","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har Nabi ne kuchh cheezein maangein ya farmaya ke har Nabi ko aik dua di gaee jis cheez ki us ne dua mangi phir usey qabool kya gaya lekin maine apni dua qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye mehfooz rakhi hui hai."
"6306","aur unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ke saiyadul-istighfaar (maghfirat maangney ke sab kalimaat ka sardaar) ye hai yun kahey اللهم أنت ربي ، Mina لا إله إلا أنت ، Mina خلقتني وأنا عبدك ، Mina وأنا على عهدك ووعدك ما استطعت ، Mina أعوذ بك من شر ما صنعت ، Mina أبوء لك بنعمتك على وأبوء بذنبي ، Mina اغفر لي ، Mina فإنه لا يغفر الذنوب إلا أنت‏ ‏ ''aey Allaah! to mera rab hai, terey siwa koi maabood nahi. tu ney hi mujhey paida kya aur main tera hi banda hun main apni taqat ke mutabiq tujh se kiye huey ahad aur wa'de par qaaim hun. un buri harkaton ke azab se jo maine ki hain teri panah mangta hun mujh par ne'matein teri hain iska iqrar karta hun. meri maghfirat kar de ke terey siwa aur koi bhi gunah nahi maaf kartaa.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne us dua ke alfaz par yaqin rakhtey huey dil se unko keh liya aur isi din iska intiqal ho gaya Sham honey se pahley , to wo jannati hai aur jisne us dua ke alfaz par yaqin rakhtey huey raat mein unko padh liya aur phir iska subah honey se pahley intiqal ho gaya to wo jannati hai."
"6307","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qism mein din mein 70 martaba se zyada Allah se istighfar aur us se tauba karta hun."
"6308","(bayaan kiin) aik Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aur dusri khud apni taraf se kaha ke momin apne gunahon ko aisa mehsus karta hai jaisey wo kisi pahaad ke nichey betha hai aur darta hai ke kahin wo iske uper na gir jaey aur badkaar apne gunahon ko makkhii ki tarah halka samajhta hai ke wo iske naak ke paas se guzri aur us ne apne hath se yun us taraf ishara kya. abu-shahaab ne naak par apne hath ke ishaare se uski kaifiyat batai phir unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye hadis bayan ki. Allah Taala apne bande ki tauba se us shakhs se bhi zyada khush hota hai jisne kisi pur-khatar jagah padao kya ho iske sath uski sawari bhi ho aur is par khaaney-peeney ki cheezein maujood hun. wo sar rakh kar so gaya ho aur jab bedaar hua ho to uski sawari ghayab rahi ho. aakhir bhook w piyaas ya jo kuchh Allah ne chaha usey sakht lag jaey wo apne dil mein sochey ke mujhey ab ghar wapas chala jana chahiye aur jab wo wapas hua aur phir so gaya lekin us neend se jo sar uthaya to uski sawari wahan khana peenaa liye huey samney khadi hai to khayal karo usko kis qadr khushi hogi. abu-shahaab ke sath is hadis ko abu-Awana aur Jarir ne bhi Aamash se riwayat kya, aur Shoba aur abu-Muslim ( Ubaidullah bin Saeed ( ne usko Aamash se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Ibrahim Taimi se, unhon-ne Haris bin Suwed se aur abu-Muawia ne yun kaha ham se Aamash ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Umara se unhon-ne Aswad bin Yazeed se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se. aur ham se Aamash ne bayan kya unhon-ne Ibrahim Taimi se, unhon-ne Haris bin Suwed se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se."
"6309","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala apne bandey ki tauba se tum mein se us shakhs se bhi zyada khush hota hai jiska oont maayoosii ke baad achcha usey mil gaya ho halanke wo aik chatiyal maidan mein gum hua tha.''"
"6310","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat main (tahajjud ki) gyara (11) rakaat padhtey they phir jab fajr tuloo ho jati to 2 halki rakaat (sunnat fajr) padhtey. iske baad aap daaein pahlu let jatey aakhir muazzan aata aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko itlaa deta to aap fajr ki Namaz padhaatey."
"6311","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa ''jab to soney lagey to Namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu kar phir daain karwat let ja aur ye dua padh اللهم أسلمت نفسي إليك ، Mina وفوضت أمري إليك ، Mina وألجأت ظهري إليك ، Mina رهبة ورغبة إليك ، Mina لا ملجأ wla منجا منك إلا إليك ، Mina آمنت بكتابك الذي أنزلت ، Mina وبنبيك الذي أرسلت‏ ''aey Allah ! maine apne aapko teri itaat mein de diya. apna sab kuchh terey sipurd kar diya. apne maamlaat terey hawale kar diye. khof ki wjah se aur teri ( rehmat w sawab ki) ummeed mein koi panah gaah koi mukhlis terey siwa nahi main teri kitab par eman laya jo to ne nazil ki hai aur terey Nabi par jinko tu ney bheja hai.'' iske baad agar tum mar gaey to fitrat (deene-Islaam par marogey to un kalimaat ko (raat ki) sabse aakhiri baat banao jinhein tum apni zaban se ada karo (Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya) maine kaha ( وبرسولك الذي أرسلت‏ ( kehney mein kya wjah hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi ( وبنبيك الذي أرسلت ( kaho."
"6312","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par let'tey to ye kehtey ( باسمك أموت وأحيا ( '' terey hi naam ke sath mein murda aur zinda rehta hon ''aur jab bedaar hotey to kehtey الحمد لله الذي أحيانا بعد ما أماتنا وإليه النشور '' usi Allah ke liye tamam ta'reefein hain jisne hamein zinda kya. iske baad ke usne maut taarii kar di thi aur usi ki taraf lautnaa hai.'' Quran sharif mein jo lafz ( ننشرها ( hai iska bhi yahi mana hai ke ham usko nikal kar uthatey hain."
"6313","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi ko hukm diya (doosri sanad) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke ham se Adam ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya unse Abu-Ishaq Hamdani ne bayan kya, aur unse Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi ko wasiiyat ki aur farmaya ke jab bistar par janey lago to ye dua padha karo اللهم أسلمت نفسي إليك ، Mina وفوضت أمري إليك ، Mina ووجهت وجهي إليك ، Mina وألجأت ظهري إليك ، Mina رغبة ورهبة إليك ، Mina لا ملجأ wla منجا منك إلا إليك ، Mina آمنت بكتابك الذي أنزلت ، Mina وبنبيك الذي أرسلت ''aey Allah ! maine apni jaan terey sipurd ki aur apna mamla tujhey saunpa aur apne aapko teri taraf mutwajjeh kya aur tujh par bharosa kya, teri taraf raghbat hai terey khof ki wjah se, tujh se terey siwa koi jaey panah nahi, main teri kitab par eman laya jo to ne nazil ki aur terey Nabi par jinhein tu ney bhejaa.'' phir agar wo maraa to fitrat (Islam) par marega."
"6314","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein bistar par let'tey to apna hath apne rukhsar ke nichey rakhtey aur ye kehtey ( اللهم باسمك أموت وأحيا ( ''aey Allaah! terey naam ke sath martaa hun aur zinda hota hoon.'' aur jab aap bedaar hotey to kehtey الحمد لله الذي أحيانا بعد ما أماتنا وإليه النشور '' tamam ta'reefein us Allah ke liye hain jisne hamein zinda kya iske baad ke hamein maut ( murad neend hai) de di thi aur teri hi taraf jana hai.''"
"6315","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par let'tey to daain pahlu par let'tey aur phir kehtey اللهم أسلمت نفسي إليك ، Mina ووجهت وجهي إليك ، Mina وفوضت أمري إليك ، Mina وألجأت ظهري إليك ، Mina رغبة ورهبة إليك ، Mina لا ملجأ wla منجا منك إلا إليك ، Mina آمنت بكتابك الذي أنزلت ، Mina ونبيك الذي أرسلت‏  aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis shakhs ne ye dua padhi aur phir us raat agar uski wafat ho gaee to uski wafat fitrat par hogi. Quran Majeed mein jo ( سترهبوهم‏ (ka lafz aaya hai ye bhi) رهبت ( se nikala hai) رهبت (ke mana dar ke hain) ( ملكوت (ka mana mulk yani saltanat jaisey kehtey hain ke) رهبوت ( , Mina ( رحموت ( se behtar hai yani daraanaa raham karne se behtar hai."
"6316","mein Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan aik raat soyaa to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey aur aap ne apni peshaab-paakhaaney ki zarurat poori karne ke baad apna chehra dhoya, phir donon hath dhoey aur phir so gaey iske baad aap khadey ho gaey aur mishkeeza ke paas gaey aur aap ne uska munh khola phir darmyaana wuzu kya ( na mubaalghe ke sath na maamooli aur halkey qism ka, teen-teen martaba se) kam dhoya. albatta pani har jagah pahuncha diya. phir aap ne Namaz padhi. main bhi khada hua aur aap ke peechhey hi raha, kyonke main usey pasand nahi karta tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye samjhein ke main aap ka intizar kar raha tha. maine bhi wuzu kar liya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khadey ho kar Namaz padhney lagey to main bhi aap ke baain taraf khada ho gaya. aap ne mera kaan pakad kar daain taraf kar diya, maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki iqtida (pairvi) mein) 13 rakaat Namaz mukammal ki. iske baad aap so gaey aur aap ki saans mein awaz paida honey lagi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab sotey they, to aap ki saans mein awaz paida honey lagti thi. iske baad Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapko Namaz ki itlaa di chunanche aap ne ( nayaa wuzu ( kiye baghair Namaz padhi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni dua mein ye kehtey they اللهم اجعل في قلبي نورا ، Mina وفي بصري نورا ، Mina وفي سمعي نورا ، Mina وعن يميني نورا ، Mina وعن يساري نورا ، Mina وفوقي نورا ، Mina وتحتي نورا ، Mina وأمامي نورا ، Mina وخلفي نورا ، Mina واجعل لي نورا''aey Allah ! mere dil mein noor paida kar, meri nazar mein noor paida kar, mere kaan mein noor paida kar, mere daain taraf noor paida kar, mere baain taraf noor paida kar, mere uper noor paida kar, mere nichey noor paida kar mere aagey noor paida kar, mere peechhey noor paida kar aur mujhey noor ata farmaa. '' Kureb ( rawi hadis) ne bayan kya ke mere paas mazeed saat (7) lafz mehfooz hain. phir maine Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke aik sahib zadey se mulaqat ki to unhon-ne mujh se unke mutaalliq bayan kya ke عصبي ولحمي ودمي وشعري وبشري ، Mina وذكر خصلتين‏ ''mere patthey, mera gosht , mera khoon , mere baal aur mera chamda un sab mein noor bhar de.'' aur 2 chizon ka aur bhi zikr kya."
"6317","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein tahajjud ke liye khadey hotey to ye dua kartey اللهم لك الحمد ، Mina أنت نور السموات والأرض ومن فيهن ، Mina ولك الحمد أنت قيم السموات والأرض ومن فيهن ، Mina ولك الحمد ، Mina أنت الحق ووعدك حق ، Mina وقولك حق ، Mina ولقاؤك حق ، Mina والجنة حق ، Mina والنار حق ، Mina والساعة حق ، Mina والنبيون حق ، Mina ومحمد حق ، Mina اللهم لك أسلمت وعليك توكلت وبك آمنت ، Mina وإليك أنبت ، Mina وبك خاصمت ، Mina وإليك حاكمت ، Mina فاغفر لي ما قدمت وما أخرت ، Mina وما أسررت ، Mina وما أعلنت ، Mina أنت المقدم وأنت المؤخر لا إله إلا أنت''aey Allah ! terey hi liye tamam ta'reefein hain to aasman w zameen aur unmein maujood tamam chizon ka noor hai, terey hi liye tamam ta'reefein hain to aasman aur zameen aur unmein maujood tamam chizon ka qaaim rakhney wala hai aur terey hi liye tamam ta'reefein hain, to haq hai, tera wada haq hai, tera qaul haq hai, tujh se milnaa haq hai, jannat haq hai, dozakh haq hai, qiyamat haq hai, anbiya haq hain aur Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) haq hain. aey Allah ! terey sipurd kya, tujh par bharosa kya, tujh par eman laya , teri taraf rujoo kya, dushmanon ka mamla terey sipurd kya, faisla terey sipurd kya, to meri agli pichhli khataein maaf kar. wo bhi jo maine chhup kar ki hain aur wo bhi jo khul kar ki hain to hi sabse pahley hai aur to hi sabse baad mein hai, sirf to hi maabood hai aur terey siwa koi maabood nahi. ''"
"6318","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne chakkii peesney ki takleef ki wjah se ke unke Mubarak hath ko sadma pahunchtaa hai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik khaadim maangney ke liye hazir huin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar mein maujood nahi they. isliye unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se zikr kya. jab aap tashrif laey to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne aap se iska zikr kya. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan tashrif laey ham us waqt tak apne bistaron par let chukey they main khada honey laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya main tum donon ko wo cheez na bata dun jo tumharey liye khaadim se bhi behtar ho. jab tum apne bistar par janey lago to tentis ( 33 ( martaba ( Allahu-akbar ( kaho , tentis ( 33 ( martaba ( sub'haanallaah ( kaho aur tentis ( 33 ( martaba ( alhamdulillah ( kaho , ye tumharey liye khaadim se behtar hai aur Shoba se riwayat hai unse Khalid ne, unse Ibne-Sirin ne bayan kya ke Subhan-Allah chauntis ( 34 ( martaba kaho."
"6319","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) let'tey to apne hathon par phoonktey aur muawwizaat padhtey aur donon hath apne jism par phertey ."
"6320","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab tum mein se koi shakhs bistar par letey to pahley apna bistar apne izaar ke kinarey se jhaad ley kyonke wo nahi janta ke uski be-khabri mein kya cheez is par aa gaee hai phir ye dua padhey باسمك رب وضعت جنبي ، Mina وبك أرفعه ، Mina إن أمسكت نفسي فارحمها ، Mina وإن أرسلتها فاحفظها بما تحفظ به الصالحين '' mere paalne waley ! terey naam se maine apna pahlu rakha hai aur terey hi naam se uthaaoonga agar tu ney meri jaan ko rok liya to is par raham karna aur agar chhod diya (zindagii baqi rakhii) to uski is tarah hifazat karna jis tarah to saaleheen ki hifazat karta hai.'' uski riwayat abu-Zamra aur Ismail bin Zakariya ne Ubaidullah ke hawale se ki aur Yahya aur Bishr ne bayan kya, unse Ubaidullah ne, unse Saeed ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aur uski riwayat Imam Malik aur ibne- Ajlan ne ki hai. unse Saeed ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is tarah riwayat ki hai."
"6321","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hamara rab tabarak w taala har raat aasman duniya ki taraf nuzool farmata hai, us waqt jab raat ka aakhiri tehai hissey baqi reh jata hai aur farmata hai kon hai jo mujh se dua karta hai ke main uski dua qabool karun kon hai jo mujh se mangta hai ke main usey dun, kon hai jo mujh se bakhshish talab karta hai ke main uski bakhshish karun."
"6322","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab baitul-khala jatey to ye dua padhtey ( اللهم إني أعوذ بك من الخبث والخبائث ( ''aey Allah ! main khabees jinon aur jinniyon ki burai se teri panah mangta hoon.''"
"6323","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sabse umda istighfar ye hai اللهم أنت ربي لا إله إلا أنت ، Mina خلقتني وأنا عبدك ، Mina وأنا على عهدك ووعدك ما استطعت ، Mina أبوء لك بنعمتك ، Mina وأبوء لك بذنبي ، Mina فاغفر لي ، Mina فإنه لا يغفر الذنوب إلا أنت ، Mina أعوذ بك من شر ما صنعت‏ ''aey Allah ! to mera paalne wala hai terey siwa koi maabood nahi tu ney mujhey paida kya aur main tera banda hun aur main terey ahad par qaaim hun aur terey wada par. jahan tak mujh se mumkin hai. teri nemat ka taalib ho kar teri panah mein aata hun aur apne gunahon se teri panah chahta hun, to to meri maghfirat farma kyonke terey siwa gunah aur koi nahi maaf karta. main teri panah mangta hun apne burey kaamon se. agar kisi ne raat hotey hi ye keh liya aur usi raat iska intiqal ho gaya to wo jannat mein jaeyga ya ( farmaya ke) wo ahle-jannat mein hoga aur agar ye dua subah ke waqt padhi aur isi din uski wafat ho gaee to bhi aisa hi hoga."
"6324","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab soney ka irada kartey to kehtey ( باسمك اللهم أموت وأحيا ( '' terey naam ke sath , aey Allah ! main martaa aur terey hi naam se jeetaa hoon.'' aur jab bedaar hotey to ye dua padhtey الحمد لله الذي أحيانا بعد ما أماتنا ، Mina وإليه النشور '' tamam ta'reefein us Allah ke liye hain jisne hamein maut ke baad zindagi bakhshii aur usi ki taraf ham ko lautnaa hai.''"
"6325","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat main apni khuwab gaah par jatey to kehtey ( اللهم باسمك أموت وأحيا ( ''aey Allah ! main terey hi naam se martaa hon aur terey hi naam se zinda hota hoon.'' aur jab bedaar hotey to farmaatey الحمد لله الذي أحيانا بعد ما أماتنا ، Mina وإليه النشور '' tamam ta'reefein us Allah ke liye hain jisne hamein maut ke baad zindagi bakhshii aur usi ki taraf ham ko jana hai.''"
"6326","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke mujhey aisi dua sikhaa dijiye jisey main apni Namaz mein padha karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye kaha kar اللهم إني zulmat نفسي ظلما كثيرا ، Mina padhi. wla يغفر الذنوب إلا أنت ، Mina padhi. فاغفر لي مغفرة من عندك ، Mina padhi. وارحمني ، Mina padhi. إنك أنت الغفور الرحيم ''aey Allah ! maine apni jaan par bahut zulm kya hai aur gunahon ko terey siwa koi maaf nahi karta to meri maghfirat kar, aisi maghfirat jo terey paas se ho aur mujh par raham kar bila shubah to bada maghfirat karne waalaa, bada raham karne wala hai.'' aur Amr-bin-Haris ne bhi us hadis ko Yazeed se, unhon-ne abul-Khair se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya aakhir tak."
"6327","( wla تجهر بصلاتك wla تخافت بها‏ ( dua ke barey mein nazil hui (ke na bahut zor-zor se aur na bilkul ahista-ahista ( balke darmyani rasta ikhtiyar karo."
"6328","ham Namaz mein ye kaha kartey they ke Allah par salam ho, falan par salam ho. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se aik din farmaya ke Allah khud salam hai isliye jab tum Namaz mein baitho to ye padha karo (التحيات لله ( irshad ( الصالحين‏) tak isliye ke jab tum ye kaho gey to aasman w zameen mein maujood Allah tabarak w taala ke har Saleh bande ko (ye salaam) pahunchega. أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله ، Mina وأشهد أن محمدا عبده ورسوله iske baad sana mein ikhtiyar hai jo dua chaho padho ."
"6329","sahaba kiram ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maaldaar log buland darjaat aur hamesha rehney wali jannat ki ne'maton ko hasil kar ley gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye kaisey ? sahaba kiram ne arz kya jis tarah ham Namaz padhtey hain wo bhi padhtey hain aur jis tarah ham jihad kartey hain wo bhi jihad kartey hain aur uske sath wo apna zayed maal bhi) Allah ke raaste mein) kharch kartey hain aur hamarey paas maal nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya main tumhen aik aisa amal na bataun jis se tum apne aagey ke logon ke sath ho jao aur apne peechhey aaney walon se aagey nikal jao aur koi shakhs itna sawab na hasil kar sakey jitna tum ne kya ho, siwa is sura ke jabke wo bhi wahi amal karey jo tum karogey (aur wo amal ye hai) ke har Namaz ke baad das martaba ( sub'haanallaah ( padha karo, das martaba ( alhamdulillah ( padha karo aur das martaba ( Allahu-akbar ( padha karo. uski riwayat Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ne Sumaii aur Rajaa bin Hewa se ki aur uski riwayat Jarir ne Abdul-Azeez bin rafeea' se ki, unse Abu-Saleh ne aur unse abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur uski riwayat Suhel ne apne walid se ki, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6330","Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Muawiya bin abi Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ko likha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har Namaz ke baad jab salam phertey to ye kaha kartey they لا إله إلا الله ، Mina وحده لا شريك له ، Mina له الملك ، Mina وله الحمد ، Mina وهو على كل شىء قدير ، Mina اللهم لا مانع لما أعطيت ، Mina wla معطي لما منعت ، Mina wla ينفع ذا الجد منك الجد ''Allaah ke siwa koi maabood nahi wo tanha hai iska koi Sharik nahi, mulk usi ke liye hai aur usi ke liye tamam ta'reefein hain aur wo har cheez par qudrat rakhney wala hai. aey Allah ! jo kuchh tu ney diya hai usey koi rokney wala nahi aur jo kuchh tu ney rok diya usey koi dene wala nahi aur kisi maaldaar aur naseebe waaley (ko teri bargah mein) uska maal nafa nahi pahuncha sakta. ''aur Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Mansoor ne bayan kya ke maine Musaiyab (Raziallahu anhu) se suna."
"6331","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar gaey (raaste mein) musalmaanon mein se kisi shakhs ne kaha Aamir ! apni qurbani ka janwar sunao. wo qurbani ka janwar padhney lagey aur kehney lagey. Allah ki qism ! agar Allah na hota to ham hidayat na paatey. iske ilawa doosrey ashaar bhi unhon-ne padhey mujhey wo yad nahi hain.(oont qurbani ka janwar sun kar tez chalney lagey to) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye sawaariyon ko kon hankaa raha hai, logon ne kaha ke Aamir bin Akwaa hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah is par raham kare. musalmaanon mein se aik shakhs ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kash! abhi aap unse hamein aur fayda uthaney detey. phir jab saf bandi hui to musalmaanon ne kaafiron se jang ki aur Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ki talwaar chhoti thi jo khud unke paon par lag gaee aur unki maut ho gaee. Sham hui to logon ne jagah-jagah aag jalaaii . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke ye aag kaisi hai, usey kyon jalaayaa gaya hai? sahaba ne kaha ke paaltu gadhon (ka gosht pakaaney) ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo kuchh haandiyon mein gosht hai usey phenk do aur haandiyon ko tod do. aik sahabi ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! ijazat ho to aisa kyon na kar lein ke haandiyon mein jo kuchh hai usey phenk dein aur haandiyon ko dho lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya achchha yahi kar lo."
"6332","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein agar koi shakhs sadqa laataa to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ke aey Allah ! falan ki aal aulad par apni rahmatein nazil farmaa. mere walid sadqa laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah ! abi uffaa ki aal aulad par rahmatein nazil farmaa."
"6333","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi aisa marde Mujahid hai jo mujh ko zul-khalsa but se aaraam pahunchaaey wo aik but tha jis ko jahiliyat mein log puja kartey they aur usko Kaba kaha kartey they. maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! us khidmat ke liye mein taiyaar hon lekin main ghodey par theek jam kar baith nahi sakta hun aap ne mere Sina par hath Mubarak pher kar dua farmai ke aey Allah ! usey Sabit qadmii ata farma aur usko hidayat karne wala aur noorey hidayat paaney wala bana . Jarir ne kaha ke phir main apni qaum Ahmas ke pachaas aadmi lekar nikla aur abi Sufiyan ne yun naql kya ke main apni qaum ki aik jamat lekar nikla aur main wahan gaya aur usey jalaa diya phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! Allah ki qism ! main aap ke paas nahi aaya jab tak maine usey jaley huey khaarish zada oont ki tarah siyah na kar diya. to aap ne qabila Ahmas aur uske ghodon ke liye dua farmai ."
"6334","Anas aap ka khaadim hai iske haq mein dua farmaiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmaaii (اللهم أكثر ماله وولده ، Mina وبارك له فيما أعطيته) ''yaa Allah ! iske maal w aulad ko zyada kar aur jo kuchh tu ney isey diya hai, usmein usey barkat ata farmaaiyo .''"
"6335","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi ko masjid mein Quran padhtey suna to farmaya Allah is par raham farmaai usne mujhey falan-falan aayatein yad dila dein jo main falan-falan Suraton se bhool gaya tha."
"6336","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi cheez taqseem farmai to aik shakhs bola ke ye aisi taqseem hai ke us se Allah ki raza maqsud nahi hai. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar di to aap is par ghussa huey aur maine narazgi ke aasaar aap ke chehre Mubarak par dekhey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Musa (Alaihissalam) par raham farmaai , unhein is se bhi zyada takleef di gaee lekin unhon-ne sabr kya."
"6337","logon ko waz (nasihat) hafte mein sirf aik din Juma ko kya kar, agar tum is par taiyaar na ho to do martaba agar tum zyada hi karna chahtey ho to bas teen din aur logon ko is Quran se uktaa na denaa, aisa na ho ke tum kuchh logon ke paas pahuncho , wo apni baton mein masroof hon aur tum pahunchtey hi unse apni baat (b-shakl wa'z) bayan karne lago aur unki aapas ki guftgu ko kaat do ke is tarah wo uktaa jayen, balke (aisey maqam par) tumhen khamosh rehnaa chahiye jab wo tum se kahey to phir tum unhein apni baatein sunao. is tarah ke wo bhi is taqreer ke khaahishmand hon aur dua mein qaafiya bandi se parhez kartey rehnaa , kyonke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke sahaba ko dekha hai ke wo hamesha aisa hi kartey they."
"6338","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tum mein se koi dua karey to Allah se qatae taur par maangey aur ye na kahey ke aey Allah ! agar to chahey to mujhey ata farma kyonke Allah par koi zabardastii karne wala nahi hai.''"
"6339","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se koi shakhs is tarah na kahey ke ya Allah ! agar to chahey to mujhey maaf kar de, meri maghfirat kar de. balke yaqin ke sath dua karey kyonke Allah par koi zabardastii karne wala nahi hai.''"
"6340","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''bande ki dua qabool hoti hai jab tak ke wo jaldi na karey ke kehney lagey ke maine dua ki thi aur meri dua qabool nahi huii.''"
"6341","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath itney uthaey ke maine aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi."
"6342","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Juma ke din khutba de rahe they ke aik aadmi khada hua aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! Allah se dua farma dijiye ke hamarey liye barish barsaey (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmaaii) aur aasman par badal chhaa gaya aur barish barasney lagi , ye haal ho gaya ke hamarey liye ghar tak pahunchnaa mushkil tha. ye barish agley Juma tak hoti rahi phir wahi sahabi ya koi doosrey sahabi us doosrey Juma ko khadey huey aur kaha ke Allah se dua farmaiye ke ab barish band kar de ham to doob gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke aey Allah ! hamarey charon taraf bastiyon ko sairaab kar aur ham par barish band kar de. chunanche badal tukdey ho kar Madina ke charon taraf bastiyon mein chala gaya aur Madina walon par barish ruk gaee."
"6343","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is eidgaah mein istisqaa (baarish k barasney ki dua) ki dua ke liye nikley aur barish ki dua ki, phir aap qibla rukh ho gaey aur apni chadar ko paltaa."
"6344","meri walida (Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Anas (Raziallahu anhu) aap ka khaadim hai uske liye dua farma dein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke aey Allah ! uske maal w aulad ko zyada kar aur jo kuchh tu ney isey diya hai is mein barkat ata farmaa."
"6345","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pareshani ke waqt ye dua kartey they (لا إله إلا الله العظيم الحليم ، Mina لا إله إلا الله رب السموات والأرض ، Mina رب العرش العظيم) ''Allaah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo bahut azmat wala hai aur burd-baar hai, Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo aasmanon aur zameen ka rab aur badey bhari arsh ka rab hai.''"
"6346","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) haalate pareshani mein ye dua kya kartey they (لا إله إلا الله العظيم الحليم ، Mina لا إله إلا الله رب العرش العظيم ، Mina لا إله إلا الله رب السموات ، Mina ورب الأرض ، Mina ورب العرش الكريم)  ''Allah sahib azmat aur burdbaar ke siwa koi maabood nahi, Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo arshe azeem ka rab hai, Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo aasmanon aur zameen ka rab hai aur arshe azeem ka rab hai.'' aur Wahab ne bayan kya ke ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne is tarah bayan kya."
"6347","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) museebat ki sakhtii, tabahi tak pahunch jaaney, qaza w qadr ki burai aur dushmanon ke khush honey se panah maangtey they aur Sufiyan ne kaha ke hadis mein teen sifaat ka bayan tha. aik maine bhulaa di thi aur mujhey yad nahi ke wo aik kon si sifaat hai."
"6348","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab bimar nahi they, to farmaya kartey they ke jab bhi kisi Nabi ki Rooh qabz ki jati to pehley jannat mein uska thikana dikhaa diya jata hai, iske baad usey ikhtiyar diya jata hai (ke chaahein duniya mein rahen ya jannat mein chalein) chunanche jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar huey aur sar Mubarak meri raan par tha. us waqt aap par thodi der ke liye ghashii taarii hui. phir jab aapko us se kuchh hosh hua to chhat ki taraf taktakii (ٹکٹکی) baandh kar dekhney lagey, phir farmaya (اللهم الرفيق الأعلى) ''aey Allah ! rafeeqe-aa'laa ke sath mila de.'' maine samajh liya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ab hamein ikhtiyar nahi kar saktey , main samajh gaee ke jo baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sihat ke zamaney mein bayan farmaya kartey they, ye wahi baat hai. bayan kya ke ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aakhiri kalima tha jo aap ne zaban se ada farmaya kaha (اللهم الرفيق الأعلى) ''aey Allah ! rafeeqe-aa'laa ke sath mila de.''"
"6349","main Khabaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua unhon-ne saat (7) dagh (kisi bimari ke ilaaj ke liye) lagwaaey they. unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar hamein maut ki dua karne se mana na kya hota to main zaroor uski dua karta."
"6350","main Khabaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua unhon-ne apne pait par saat (7) dagh lagwaa (لگوا) rakhey they, maine suna ke wo keh rahe they ke agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein maut ki dua karne se mana na kya hota to main uski zaroor dua kar letaa."
"6351","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se koi shakhs kisi takleef ki wjah se jo usey honey lagi ho, maut ki tamanna na kare. agar maut ki tamanna zaroori hi ho jaey to ye kahey ke aey Allah ! jab tak mere liye zindagi behtar hai mujhey zinda rakhiyo aur jab mere liye maut behtar ho to mujhey utha liijiyo.''"
"6352","meri khala mujhey lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mera ye bhanja bimar hai. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere sar par hath phera aur mere liye barkat ki dua ki. phir aap ne wuzu kya aur maine aap ke wuzu ka pani piyaa . iske baad main aap ki pusht ki taraf khada ho gaya aur maine mohare nabwooat dekhi jo donon shaanon ke darmyan mein thi jaisey chhappar khat ki ghunddii (ghundii) hoti hai ya hajla (chakor ki tarah ka ek parinda) ka anda."
"6353","unhein unke dada Abdullah-bin Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) sath lekar bazar se nikaltey ya bazar jatey aur khaney ki koi cheez khareedtey, phir agar Abdullah-bin-Zubair ya Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki unse mulaqat ho jati to wo kehtey ke hamein bhi usmein Sharik kijiye ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aap ke liye barkat ki dua farmai thi. kuchh baar to aik oont ke bojh ka pura ghalla nafey mein aa jata aur wo usey ghar bhej detey they."
"6412","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''do ne'matein aisi hain ke aksar log unki qadr nahi kartey, sihat aur faraaghat.'' Abbas Anbari ne bayan kya ke ham se Safwan bin Esa ne bayan kya, unse Abdullah-bin-Ubai Hind ne, unse unke walid ne ke maine Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi hadis ki tarah ."
"6413","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (اللهم لا عيش إلا عيش الآخره ، Mina padhi. فأصلح الأنصار والمهاجره) ''aey Allah ! aakhirat ki zindagi ke siwa aur koi zindagi nahi. isliiye to Ansar w muhajireen mein salaah ko baqi rakh.''"
"6414","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Khandaq ki jang ke mauqe par maujood they, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi khandaq khodtey jatey they aur ham mitti ko uthatey jatey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey qareeb se guzartey huey farmaatey                         (اللهم لا عيش إلا عيش الآخره ، Mina فاغفر للأنصار والمهاجره) ''aey Allah ! zindagi to bas aakhirat hi ki zindagi hai, isliiye tu ansaar w muhajireen ki maghfirat kar.'' us riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki hai."
"6415","maine aapko ye farmatey huey suna ke jannat mein aik kode jitni jagah duniya aur is mein jo kuchh hai sabse behtar hai aur Allah ke rastey mein subah ko ya Sham ko thoda sa chalnaa bhi duniya aur jo kuch usmein hai se behtar hai."
"6416","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera shana pakad kar farmaya ''duniyaa mein is tarah ho ja jaisey to musaafir ya rasta chalney wala ho.''  Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) farmaya kartey they Sham ho jaey to subah ke muntazir na raho aur subah ke waqt Sham (Syria) ke muntazir na raho, apni seihat ko marz se pahley ghaneemat jano aur zindagi ko maut se pahley ."
"6417","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaukhtaa khat kheenchaa . phir iske darmyan aik khat kheenchaa jo chaukhtey ke darmyan mein tha. iske baad darmyan waley khat ke us hissey mein jo chaukhtey ke darmyan mein tha chhotey chhotey bahut se khutoot kheenchey aur phir farmaya ke ye insan hai aur ye uski maut hai jo usey gherey huey hai aur ye jo (beech ka ( khat bahar nikla hua hai wo uski ummeed hai aur chhotey chhotey khutoot uski duniyawi mushkilaat hain. isliiye insan jab aik (mushkil) se bach kar nikalta hai to dusri mein phans jata hai aur dusri se nikalta hai to teesri mein phans jata hai."
"6418","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand khutoot kheenchey aur farmaya ke ye ummeed hai aur ye maut hai, insan usi haalat (ummeed tak pahunchne ki) mein rehta hai ke qareeb wala khat (maut) us tak pahunch jata hai."
"6419","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne us aadmi ke uzr ke silsiley mein hujjat tamam kar di jiski maut ko dair huii  yahan tak ke wo saa'tth (60) saal ki umr ko pahunch gaya. ''us riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) abu-Hazim aur ibne-ajlaan ne Maqbari se ki."
"6420","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''boodhey insan ka dil do chizon ke barey mein hamesha jawan rehtaa hai, duniya ki mohabbat aur zindagi ki lambi ummeed.'' Leis ne bayan kya ke mujh se Yunus ne bayan kya aur Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se bayan kya ke mujhey Saeed aur abu-Salma ne khabar di."
"6421","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' insan ki umr badhtii jati hai aur uske sath do cheezein uske andar badhtii jati hain. maal ki mohabbat aur umr ki daraazii.'' uski riwayat Shoba ne Qatada se ki hai."
"6422","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye baat khub mere zahan mein mehfooz hai. unhein yad hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke aik dol mein se pani lekar mujh par kulli kar di thi."
"6423","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey aur farmaya ''koii banda jab qiyamat ke din us haalat mein pesh hoga ke usne kalima ( لا إله إلا الله (ka iqrar kya hoga aur is se uska maqsad Allah ki khushnoodii hasil karna hogi to Allah Taala dozakh ki aag ko is par haram kar dega.''"
"6424","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke mere us momin bandey ka jis ki, mein koi azeez cheez duniya se utha loon aur wo is par sawab ki niyat se sabr kar ley , to uska badla mere yahan jannat ke siwa aur kuchh nahi. ''"
"6425","Amr-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) jo bani Aamir bin Adi ke dost they aur badr ki ladai main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, unhon-ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Ubaida bin Jarrah (Raziallahu anhu) ko Bahrain wahan ka jiziya laney ke liye bhejaa, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bahrain walon se suleh kar li thi aur un par Alaa-bin-Al-Hizramii (الحضرمی) ko ameer muqarrar kya tha. jab abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) Bahrain se jiziya ka maal lekar aaey to Ansar ne unke aaney ke mutaalliq suna aur subah ki Namaz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padhi aur jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein dekh kar muskuraaey aur farmaya mera khayal hai ke abu-Ubaida ke aaney ke mutaalliq tum ne sun liya hai aur ye bhi ke wo kuchh lekar aaey hain? Ansar ne arz kya : ji haan , ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tumhen khushkhabri ho tum uski ummeed rakho jo tumhen khush kar degi , Allah ki qism ! ghariibii w mohtaajii wo cheez nahi hai jis se main tumharey mutaalliq darta hun balke main to us se darta hun ke duniya tum par bhi isi tarah kushaada kar di jaeygi, jis tarah un logon par kar di gaee thi jo tum se pahley they aur tum bhi uske liye aik doosrey se aagey badhney ki isi tarah koshish karogey jis tarah wo kartey they aur tumhen bhi isi tarah ghaafil kar degi jis tarah unko ghaafil kya tha."
"6426","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur jange-Uhud ke shaheedon ke liye is tarah Namaz padhi jis tarah murda par Namaz padhi jati hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimber par tashrif laey aur farmaya aakhirat mein main tum se aagey jaaunga aur main tum par gawah hunga , Allah ki qism main apne hauz ko us waqt bhi dekh raha hun aur mujhey zameen ke khazaanon ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain ya (farmaayaa ke) zameen ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain aur Allah ki qism ! main tumharey mutaalliq us se nahi darta ke tum mere baad shirk karogey balke mujhey tumharey mutaalliq ye khof hai ke tum duniya ke liye aik doosrey se aagey badhney ki koshish karne lago gey ."
"6427","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumharey mutaalliq sabse zyada us se khof khata hon ke jab Allah Taala zameen ki barkatein tumharey liye nikal dega. puchha gaya zameen ki barkatein kya hain? farmaya ke duniya ki chamak damak , is par aik sahabi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha kya bhalai se burai paida ho sakti hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par khamosh ho gaey aur ham ne khayal kya ke shayad aap par wahi nazil ho rahi hai. iske baad apni peshani ko saaf karne lagey aur malum farmaya, poochhney waley kahan hain? poochhney waley ne kaha ke hazir hun. Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab us sawal ka hal hamarey samney aa gaya to ham ne un sahib ki tareef ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bhalai se to sirf bhalai hi paida hoti hai lekin ye maal sar-sabz aur khushgawaar (ghaas ki tarah) hai aur jo cheez bhi Rabe ke mausam mein ugtii hain wo laalech ke sath khaney walon ko halaak kar deti hain ya halaakat ke qareeb pahuncha deti hain. siwaey us janwar ke jo pet bhar ke khaaey ke jab us ne kha liya aur uski donon kokh bhar gain to usne suraj ki taraf munh karke jugaalii kar li aur phir pakhana peshab kar diya aur uske baad phir lot ke kha liya aur ye maal bhi bahut meethaa hai jisne usey haq ke sath liya aur haq mein kharch kya to wo behtreen zariia' hai aur jisne usey naajaaiz tareeqe se hasil kya to wo us shakhs jaisa hai jo khata hai lekin ranjeedaa nahi hota."
"6428","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein sabse behtar mera zamana hai, phir un logon ka zamana hai jo uske baad hongey. '' Imran ne bayan kya ke mujhey nahi malum Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat ko do martaba dohraya ya teen martaba . phir iske baad wo log hongey ke wo gawahi dengey lekin unki gawahi qabool nahi ki jaeygi, wo khayanat karengey aur un par se bharosaa jata rahega. wo nazar maanein gey lekin poori nahi karengey aur unmein mutaapaa phail jaeyga"
"6429","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse behtar mera zamana hai, iske baad un logon ka jo iske baad hongey phir jo unke baad hongey aur uske baad aisey log paida hongey jo qism se pehley gawahi dengey kabhi gawahi se pehley qism khaaengey.''"
"6430","maine Khubbaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, us din unke pet mein saat (7) dagh lagaey gaey they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar hamein maut ki dua karne se mana na kya hota to main apni maut ki dua karta. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba guzar gaey aur duniya ne unke (aa'maal khair mein se) kuchh nahi ghataayaa aur ham ne duniya se itna kuchh hasil kya ke mitti ke siwa uski koi jagah nahi."
"6431","main Khubbaab-bin-Arat (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, wo apne makan ki diwar banwaa rahe they, unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey sathi jo guzar gaey duniya ne unke nek aamaal mein se kuchh kami nahi ki lekin unke baad ham ko itna paisaa (پیسہ) mila ke ham usko kahan kharch karein bas is mitti aur pani yani Imaarat mein ham ko usey kharch ka mauqa mila hai."
"6432","ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath hijrat ki thi aur iska qissa bayan kya."
"6433","main Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye wuzu ka pani lekar aaya wo chabootrey par baithey huey they, phir unhon-ne achi tarah wuzu kya. iske baad kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko isi jagah wuzu kartey huey dekha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne achi tarah wuzu kya, phir farmaya ke jisne is tarah wuzu kya aur phir masjid mein aa kar do rakaat Namaz padhi to uske pichhley gunah maaf ho jatey hain. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par ye bhi farmaya ke is par maghroor (مغرور) na ho jao."
"6434","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''neik log ek baad doosrey guzar jaeinge iske baad jau ke bhoosey ya khajoor ke kachrey ki tarah kuchh log duniya mein reh jaeinge jinki Allah paak ko kuchh zara bhi parwaa na hogi. '' imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha (حفالة) aur (حثالة‏ ( donon ke aik mana hain."
"6435","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''diinaar w dirham ke bandey , umda reshamii chaadaron ke bandey , siyah kamlii ke bandey , tabah ho gaey ke agar unhein diya jaey to wo khush ho jatey hain aur agar na diya jaey to naraz rahtey hain.''"
"6436","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar insan ke paas maal ki do wadiyan hon to teesri ka khaahishmand hoga aur insan ka pait mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur Allah us shakhs ki tauba qabool karta hai jo (dil se) sachchii tauba karta hai.''"
"6437","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar insan ke paas maal ( bhaid-bakrii ( ki poori wadi ho to wo chaahega ke usey waisii hi aik aur mil jaey aur insan ki aankh mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur jo Allah se tauba karta hai, wo uski tauba qabool karta hai'' Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey malum nahi ye Quran mein se hai ya nahi. bayan kya ke maine ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye member par kehtey suna tha."
"6438","maine Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko Makka Mukarrama mein member par ye kehtey suna. unhon-ne apne khutbe mein kaha ke aey logo ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke agar insan ko aik wadi sona bhar ke de diya jaey to wo dusri ka khaahishmand rahega agar dusri de di jaey to teesri ka khaahishmand rahega aur insan ka pet mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur Allah paak uski tauba qabool karta hai jo tauba kare."
"6439","aur unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar insan ke paas soney ki aik wadi ho to wo chaahega ke 2 ho jayen aur iska munh qabr ki mitti ke siwa aur koi cheez nahi bhar sakti aur Allah uski tauba qabool karta hai jo tauba kare. ''"
"6440","ham usey Quran hi mein se samajhtey they yahan tak ke aayat (ألهاكم التكاثر‏) nazil hui."
"6441","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey ata farmaya, maine phir maanga aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir ata farmaya, maine phir maanga aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir ata farmaya, phir farmaya ke ye maal aur kabhi-kabhi Sufiyan ne yun bayan kya ke (hakeem (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya) aey hakeem ! ye maal sar-sabz aur khushgawaar nazar aata hai isliye jo shakhs usey nek niyatii (نیتی) se ley usmein barkat hoti hai aur jo laalach ke sath leta hai to uske maal mein barkat nahi hoti balke wo us shakhs jaisa ho jata hai jo khata jata hai lekin uska pet nahi bharta aur uper ka hath nichey ke hath se behtar hai."
"6442","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein kon hai jisey apne maal se zyada apne waaris ka maal pyara ho.'' sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham mein koi aisa nahi jisey maal zyada pyara na ho. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya'' phir uska maal wo hai jo usney (maut se) pahley (Allah ke raaste mein kharch) kya aur uske waaris ka maal wo hai jo wo chhod kar maraa .''"
"6443","aik roz mein bahar nikla to dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tanha chal rahe they aur aap ke sath koi bhi na tha, Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke is se main samjha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isey pasand nahi farmaaengey ke aap ke sath us waqt koi rahe. isliye main chaand ke saaey main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey-peechhey chalney laga. iske baad aap mudey to mujhey dekha aur malum farmaya kon hai? maine arz kya : abu-Zar! Allah mujhey aap par qurbaan kare. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Zar! yahan aao. bayan kya ke phir main thodi der tak aap ke sath chalta raha. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo log (duniyaa mein) zyada maal w daulat jama kiye huey hain qiyamat ke din wahi khasaarey mein hongey. siwaey unke jinhein Allah Taala ne maal diya ho aur unhon-ne usey daaein baaein, aagey-peechhey kharch kya ho aur usey bhaley kaamon mein lagaya ho. (abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne) bayan kya ke phir thodi der tak main aap ke sath chalta raha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, baith jao. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aik hamwaar zameen par bitha diya jiske charon taraf patthar they aur farmaya ke haan, us waqt tak baithey raho jab tak main tumharey paas lot aaoon. phir aap pathreelii zameen ki taraf chaley gaey aur nazron se ojhal ho gaey. aap wahan rahe aur der tak wahin rahe. phir maine aap se suna, aap ye kehtey huey tashrif la rahe they '' chahey chori ho, chahey zina ho '' Abu-Zar kehtey hain ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to mujh se sabr nahi ho saka aur maine arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! Allah aap par mujhey qurbaan kare. is pathreelii zameen ke kinarey aap kis se baatein kar rahe they. maine to kisi doosrey ko aap se baat kartey nahi dekhaa? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) they. pathreelii zameen (Harra) ke kinarey wo mujh se miley aur kaha ke apni ummat ko khushkhabri suna do ke jo bhi us haal mein marega ke Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko Sharik na thahraataa ho to wo jannat mein jaeyga maine arz kya : aey Jibraaiil! chahe us ne chori ki ho, zina kya ho? Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha haan, chahe usne sharab hi pi ho. nazar ne bayan kya ke hamein Shoba ne khabar di (kahaa) ham se Habib bin abi saabit, Aamash aur Abdul-Azeez bin rafeea' ne bayan kya, unse Zaid-bin Wahab ne isi tarah bayan kya. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha Abu-Saleh ne jo usi baab mein abu-Darda se riwayat ki hai wo munqata' hai) Abu-Saleh ne abu-Darda se nahi suna (aur sahi nahi hai ham ne ye bayan kar diya taake us hadis ka haal malum ho jaey aur sahi Abu-Zar ki hadis hai (jo uper mazkoor hui ( kisi ne imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se puchha Ata-bin-Yasar ne bhi to ye hadis abu-Darda se riwayat ki hai. unhon-ne kaha wo bhi munqata' hai aur sahi nahi hai. aakhir sahi wahi Abu-Zar ki hadis niklii. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha abu-Darda ki hadis ko chhodo (wo sanad leney ke laaiq nahi hai kyonke wo munqata' hai) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke Abu-Zar ki hadis ka matlab ye hai ke martey waqt aadmi ( لا إله إلا الله ( kahey aur tauheed par khaatma ho (to wo aik na aik din zaroor jannat mein jaeyga chahey kitna hi gunahgaar ho) . kuchh nuskhon mein ye hai) هذا اذا تاب وقال لا إله إلا الله عند الموت ( yani Abu-Zar ki hadis us shakhs ke barey mein hai jo gunah se tauba karey aur martey waqt ( لا إله إلا الله ( kahey ."
"6444","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke pathreeley ilaqe mein chal raha tha ke Uhud pahaad hamarey samney aa gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya : Abu-Zar ! maine arz kya, hazir hun ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey is se bilkul khushi nahi hogi ke mere paas is Uhud ke barabar sona ho aur is par teen din is tarah guzar jayen ke usmein se aik Dinar bhi baqi reh jaey siwa us thodi si raqam ke jo main qarz ki adaaeygi ke liye chhod dun balke mein usey Allah ke bandon mein is tarah kharch karun apni daain taraf se, baain taraf se aur peechhey se. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaltey rahe, iske baad farmaya, zyada maal jama rakhney waley hi qiyamat ke din muflis hongey siwa us shakhs ke jo us maal ko is-is tarah daain taraf se, baain taraf se aur peechhey se kharch karey aur aisey log kam hain. phir mujh se farmaya, yahin thahrey raho, yahan se us waqt tak na jana jab tak main aa na jaun. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ki taareeki mein chaley gaey aur nazron se ojhal ho gaey. iske baad maine awaz suni jo buland thi. mujhey dar laga ke kahin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko koi dushwari na pesh aa gaee ho. maine aap ki khidmat mein pahunchne ka irada kya lekin aap ka irshad yad aaya ke apni jagah se na hatna , jab tak main na aa jaun. chunanche jab tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif nahi laey main wahan se nahi hataa. phir aap aaey maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! maine aik awaz suni thi, mujhey dar laga lekin phir aap ka irshad yad aaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya kya tum ne suna tha? maine arz kya, ji haan. farmaya ke wo Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) they aur unhon-ne kaha ke aap ki ummat ka jo shakhs is haal mein mar jaey ke usne Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik na kya ho to jannat mein jaeyga maine puchha chahe us ne zina aur chori bhi ki ho? unhon-ne kaha haan zina aur chori hi kyon na ki ho."
"6445","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar mere paas Uhud pahaad ke barabar bhi sona ho to mujhey usmein khushi hogi ke teen din bhi mujh par is haal mein na guzarney paaein ke usmein se mere paas kuchh bhi baqi bachchey . albatta agar kisi ka qarz door karne ke liye kuchh rakh chhodun to ye aur baat hai."
"6446","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''maaldaarii ye nahi hai ke saman zyada ho, balke maaldaarii ye hai ke dil ghanii (maaldaar) ho. ''"
"6447","aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney se guzra to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik doosrey shakhs Abu-Zar-Ghifaarii (Raziallahu anhu) se jo aap ke qareeb baithey huey they, puchha ke us shakhs ( guzrey waale) ke mutaalliq tum kya kehtey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke ye muazzaz logon mein se hai aur Allah ki qism ! ye is qaabil hai ke agar ye paighaame-nikaah bhejey to us se nikah kar diya jaey. agar ye sifarish karey to unki sifarish qabool kar li jaey. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye sun kar khamosh ho gaey. iske baad aik doosrey sahib guzrey . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse unke mutaalliq bhi puchha ke unke barey mein tumhari kya raey hai? unhon-ne kaha, ya Rasulullah ! ye sahib musalmanon ke ghareeb tabqey se hain aur ye aisey hain ke agar ye nikah ka paigham bhejein to unka nikah na kya jaey, agar ye kisi ki sifarish karein to unki sifarish qabool na ki jaey aur agar kuchh kahein to unki baat na suni jaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad farmaya ke Allah ke nazdeek ye pichhlaa mohtaaj shakhs agley maaldaar shakhs se, bhale hi waisey aadmi zameen bhar kar hon, behtar hai."
"6448","ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Allah Taala ki raza hasil karne ke liye hijrat ki. chunanche hamara ajr Allah ke zimme raha. to ham mein se koi to guzar gaya aur apna ajr (is duniya mein) nahi liya. Mus'ab-bin-Umair (Raziallahu anhu)) unhi ( mein se they, wo jange-Uhud ke mauqe par Shahid ho gaey they aur aik chadar chhodi thi (is chadar ka unko kafan diya gaya tha) us chadar se ham agar unka sar dhaktey to unke paon khul jatey aur paon dhaktey to sar khul jata. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham unka sar dhak dein aur paon par izkhir ghaas daal dein aur koi ham mein se aisey huey jinke phal khub pakey aur wo mazey se chun chun kar kha rahe hain."
"6449","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''maine jannat mein jhanka to usmein rehney waley aksar ghareeb log they aur maine dozakh mein jhanka to uski rehney waaliyaan aksar auratein thin. ''abu-Rijaa ke sath is hadis ko Ayub sakhtiyan aur Auf ne bhi riwayat kya hai aur sakhr bin Juweriya aur Hammad bin najeeh donon is hadis ko abu-Rijaa se, unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya."
"6450","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi mez par khana nahi khaayaa. yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gaee aur na wafat tak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi baareek chapaatii khaaii."
"6451","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to mere toshey-khaane mein koi ghalla na tha jo kisi jaandaar ke khaney ke qaabil hota, siwa thodey se jau ke jo mere toshey mein they, main unmein hi se khaatii rahi aakhir uktaa kar jab bahut din ho gaey to maine unhein naapaa to wo khatm ho gaey."
"6452","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they ke Allah ki qism jiske siwa koi maabood nahi main (zamaana nabwi mein) bhook ke maarey zameen par apne pet ke bal let jata tha aur kabhi main bhook ke maarey apne pet par patthar baandha karta tha. aik din mein us rastey par baith gaya jis se sahaba nikaltey they Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) guzrey aur maine unse kitabullah ki aik aayat ke barey mein poochha, mere poochhney ka maqsad sirf ye tha ke wo mujhey kuchh khilaa dein magar wo chaley gaey aur kuchh nahi kya. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas se guzrey, maine unse bhi Quran Majeed ki aik aayat poochhi aur poochhney ka maqsad sirf ye tha ke wo mujhey kuchh khilaa dein magar wo bhi guzar gaey aur kuchh nahi kya. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guzrey aur aap ne jab mujhey dekha to aap muskuraa diye aur jo mere dil main aur jo mere chehrey par tha aap ne pehchan liya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Huraira! maine arz kya labbaik, ya Rasulullah ! farmaya mere sath aa jao aur aap chalney lagey. main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey chal diya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar ghar mein tashrif ley gaey. phir maine ijazat chahi aur mujhey ijazat milii. jab aap dakhil huey to aik pyaley mein doodh mila. malum farmaya ke ye doodh kahan se aaya hai? kaha falan ya fulaanii ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye tohfe mein bheja hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Huraira! maine arz kya labbaik, ya Rasulullah ! farmaya, ahale-suffa ke paas jao aur unhein bhi mere paas bula laao. kaha ke ahale-suffa Islam ke mehmaan hain, wo na kisi ke ghar panah dhoondhtey , na kisi ke maal main aur na kisi ke paas ! jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas sadqa aata to usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhiin ke paas bhej detey aur khud usmein se kuchh na rakhtey. albatta jab aap ke paas tohfa aata to unhein bulwa bhejtey aur khud bhi usmein se kuchh khaatey aur unhein bhi Sharik kartey. chunanche mujhey ye baat na-gawar guzri aur maine sochaa ke ye doodh hai hi kitna ke sarey suffa walon mein taqseem ho, iska haqdaar main tha ke usey pi kar kuchh quwwat hasil karta. jab suffa waley aaeingey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujh se farmaaengey aur main unhein usey de doonga . mujhey to shayad us doodh mein se kuchh bhi nahi milega lekin Allah aur uske rasool ki hukm-bardaarii ke siwa koi aur chaara bhi nahi tha. chunanche main unke paas aaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dawat pahunchaaii, wo aagey aur ijazat chaahi. unhein ijazat mil gaee phir wo ghar main apni apni jagah baith gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : abu-Huraira! maine arz kya labbaik , ya Rasulullah ! farmaya lo aur usey un sab haaziriin ko de do. bayan kya ke phir maine piyala pakad liya aur eik-eik ko diye laga. aik shakhs doodh pi kar jab sairaab ho jata to mujhey piyala wapas kar deta phir doosrey shakhs ko deta wo bhi sairaab ho kar peetaa phir piyala mujh ko wapas kar deta aur isi tarah teesra pi kar phir mujhey piyala wapas kar deta. is tarah main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahuncha log pi kar sairaab ho chukey they. aakhir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne piyala pakda aur apne hath par rakh kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri taraf dekha aur muskuraa kar farmaya, abu-Huraira! maine arz kya, labbaik, ya Rasulullah! farmaya, ab main aur tum baqi reh gaey hain. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ne sach farmaya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya baith jao aur piyo . main baith gaya aur maine doodh piyaa aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) barabar farmatey rahe ke aur piyo aakhir mujhey kehna padaa, nahi us zaat ki qism jisne aapko haq ke sath bheja hai, ab bilkul gunjaaish nahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, phir mujhey de do, maine piyala Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko de diya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur bismillaah padh kar bacha hua khud pi gaey."
"6453","main sabse pahlaa Arab hun jisne Allah ke rastey mein teer chillaey . ham ne us haal mein waqt guzara hai ke jihad kar rahe hain aur hamarey paas khaney ki koi cheez habla ke patton aur us babool ke siwa khaney ke liye nahi thi aur bakri ki mengniyon ki tarah ham pakhana kiya kartey they. ab ye banu-Asad ke log mujh ko Islam sikhlaa kar durust karna chahtey hain phir to main bilkul bad-naseeb thehra aur mera Sara kya karaya akaarat gaya."
"6454","Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar walon ko Madina aaney ke baad kabhi teen din tak barabar gehun ki roti khaney ke liye nahi mili , yahan tak ki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rooh qabz ho gaee."
"6455","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke gharaane ne agar kabhi aik din mein 2 martaba khana khaya to zaroor usmein aik waqt sirf khajoorein hoti thin."
"6456","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bistar chamdey ka tha aur is mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi."
"6457","ham Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hotey, unka naan baaii wahin maujood hota (jo rotiyaan pakka pakaa kar deta jaataa) Anas (Raziallahu anhu) logon se kehtey ke khaao, maine kabhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko patlii roti khaatey nahi dekha aur na Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi apni aankh se samoochii bhunii hui bakri dekhi. yahan tak ke aap ka intiqal ho gaya."
"6458","hamarey uper aisa mahina bhi guzar jata tha ke choolha nahi jaltaa tha, sirf khajoor aur pani hota tha, haan agar kabhi kisi jagah se kuchh thoda sa gosht aa jata to usko bhi kha letey they."
"6459","unhon-ne Urwa se kaha, betey! ham 2 mahinon mein teen chaand dekh letey hain aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki beeviyon) ke gharon mein choolha nahi jaltaa tha. maine puchha phir aap log zinda kis cheez par rehti thin ? batlaya ke sirf 2 kali chizon par, khajoor aur pani . haan , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kuchh Ansari padosi they jinke yahan dudhail oontniyan thin wo apne gharon se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye doodh bhej detey aur aap hamein wahi doodh pilaa detey they."
"6460","ham se Abdullah-bin Muhammad ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se Muhammad-bin-Fuzail ne bayan kya, unse unke walid ne, unse Umara ne, unse Abu-Zaraa ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne duaa ki ke aey Allaah! aale-Muhammad ko itnii rozii dey ke wo zinda reh sakein."
"6461","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se poochha, kon si ibadat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada pasand thi, farmaya ke jis par hameshgii ho sakey, kaha ke maine puchha aap raat ko tahajjud ke liye Kab uthtey they? batlaya ke jab murgh ki awaz sun letey."
"6462","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sabse zyada pasandida wo amal tha jis ko aadmi hamesha karta rahe."
"6463","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum se kisi shakhs ko iska amal nijat nahi dila sakega.'' sahaba ne kaha aur aapko bhi nahi ya rasoolullaah? farmaya ''aur mujhey bhi nahi, siwa iske ke Allah Taala mujhey apni rehmat ke saaye mein ley ley. to tum ko chahiye ke durustii ke sath amal karo aur miyaanaa rawii ikhtiyar karo. subah aur Shaam, isi tarah raat ko zara sa chal liya karo aur aetidaal ke sath chala karo manzil maqsud ko pahunch jaogey .''"
"6464","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''darmyaanii chaal ikhtiyar karo aur buland parwaazii na karo aur amal kartey raho, tum mein se kisi ka amal usey jannat mein nahi dakhil kar sakega , mere nazdeek sabse pasandida amal wo hai jis par hameshgii ki jaey chahe kam hi kyon na ho.''"
"6465","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya kon sa amal Allah ke nazdeek zyada pasandida hai? farmaya ke jis par hameshgii ki jaey, chahe wo thodi hi ho aur farmaya nek kaam karne mein itni hi takleef uthao jitni taqat hai (jo hamesha nibh sakey)."
"6466","maine Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha : ummul-momeneen! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kyonkar ibadat kya kartey they kya aap ne kuchh khas din khas kar rakhey they? batlaya ke nahi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke amal mein hameshgii hoti thi aur tum mein kon hai jo in amalon ki taqat rakhta ho jinki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) taqat rakhtey they."
"6467","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' dekho jo nek kaam karo theek taur se karo aur had se na badh jao balke iske qareeb raho (beech ki ravish ikhtiyar karo) aur khush raho aur yad rakho ke koi bhi apne amal ki wjah se jannat mein nahi jaeyga sahaba ne arz kya : aur aap bhi nahi ya Rasulullah ! farmaya aur main bhi nahi. siwa iske ke Allah apni maghfirat w rehmat ke saaye mein mujhey dhaank ley. madeenii ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke Musa-bin-Aqba ne ye hadis abu-Salma se Abul-Nasar ke waastey se suni hai, abu-Salma ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se. aur Affaan-bin-Muslim ne bayan kya ke ham se Wuhaib ne bayan kya, unse Musa-bin-Aqba ne bayan kya, kaha ke maine abu-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se suna aur unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''durustii ke sath amal karo aur khush raho.''"
"6468","maine Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein aik din Namaz padhai, phir member par chadhey aur apne hath se masjid ke qible ki taraf ishara kya aur farmaya ke us waqt jab maine tumhen Namaz padhai to mujhey us diwar ki taraf jannat aur dozakh ki tasweer dikhai gaee maine ( saari umr mein) aaj ki tarah na koi jannat ki si khoobsurat cheez dekhi na dozakh ki si daraawnii , maine aaj ki tarah na koi jannat jaisi khoobsurat cheez dekhi na dozakh jaisi daraawnii cheez ."
"6469","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne rehmat ko jis din banaya to uske so hissey kiye aur apne paas unmein se niniyaanwey rakhey. iske baad tamam makhlooq ke liye sirf aik hissey rehmat ka bhejaa. to agar kaafir ko wo tamam raham malum ho jaey jo Allah ke paas hai to wo jannat se naa-ummeed na ho aur agar momin ko wo tamam azab malum ho jayen jo Allah ke paas hain to dozakh se kabhi be-khauf na ho."
"6470","chand Ansari sahaba ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga aur jisne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maanga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey diya, yahan tak ke jo maal aap ke paas tha wo khatm ho gaya. jab sab kuchh khatm ho gaya jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne donon hathon se diya tha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo bhi achi cheez mere paas hogi main usey tum se bacha ke nahi rakhta hun. baat ye hai ke jo tum mein (sawaal se) bachta rahega Allah bhi usey ghaib se dega aur jo shakhs dil par zor daal kar sabr karega Allah bhi usey sabr dega aur jo be-parwaah rehna ikhtiyar karega Allah bhi usey be-parwaah kar dega aur Allah ki koi nemat sabr se badh kar tum ko nahi milii."
"6471","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) itni Namaz padhtey ke aap ke qadmon mein waram aa jata ya kaha ke aap ke qadam phool jatey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha jata ke aap to bakhshey huey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey hain ke kya main Allah ka shukr-guzar banda na banoon."
"6472","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meri ummat ke 70 hazaar log be-hisaab jannat mein jaengey. ye wo log hongey jo jhaad phoonk nahi karatey na shagoon letey hain aur apne rab hi par bharosa rakhtey hain.''"
"6473","koi hadis jo aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni ho wo mujhey likh bhejo. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein likha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, aap Namaz se farigh honey ke baad ye dua padhtey لا إله إلا الله ، Mina وحده لا شريك له ، Mina له الملك ، Mina وله الحمد ، Mina وهو على كل شىء قدير ke ''Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo tanha hai uska koi Sharik nahi, badhshahat usi ki hai aur tamam ta'reefein usi ke liye hain aur wo har cheez par qudrat rakhney wala hai.'' ye teen martaba padhtey. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) be-faayda baat cheet karne, zyada sawal karne, maal zaaye karne, apni cheez bacha kar rakhney aur dusron ki maangtey rahney, maaon ki nafarmani karne aur ladkiyon ko zinda dargor karne se mana farmatey they. aur Hushaim se riwayat hai, unhein Abdul-Malik ibne-Umair ne khabar di, kaha ke maine Waraad se suna, wo ye hadis Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kartey they aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6474","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' mere liye jo shakhs donon jabdon ke darmyan ki cheez ( zaban (aur donon taangon ke darmyan ki cheez ( sharmgah ( ki zimme-dari dedey mein uske liye jannat ki zimme-dari deta hoon.''"
"6475","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta hai usey chahiye ke achi baat kahey warna khamosh rahe aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta hai wo apne padosi ko takleef na pahunchaaey aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo apne mehman ki izzat kare. ''"
"6476","mere donon kanon ne suna hai aur mere dil ne yad rakha hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha '' mehmani teen din ki hoti hai magar jo lazimi hai wo to poori karo. puchha gaya lazimi kitni hai? farmaya ke aik din aur aik raat aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta hai usey chahiye ke apne mehman ki khaatir karey aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta hai usey chahiye ke achi baat kahey warna chup rahe."
"6477","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' banda aik baat zaban se nikaaltaa hai aur uske mutaalliq sochtaa nahi (kitnii kufr aur be-adabii ki baat hai) jiski wjah se wo dozakh ke garhey mein itni door gir padta hai jitna maghrib se mashriq door hai.''"
"6478","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' banda Allah ki raza-mandi ke liye aik baat zaban se nikaaltaa hai usey wo koi ahmiyat nahi deta magar usi ki wjah se Allah uske darjey buland kar deta hai aur aik doosra banda aik aisa kalima zaban se nikaaltaa hai jo Allah ki narazagi ka baais hota hai usey wo koi ahmiyat nahi deta lekin uski wjah se wo jahannam mein chala jata hai.''"
"6479","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' saat (7) tarah ke log wo hain jinhein Allah Taala apne saaye mein panah dega. (un mein) aik wo shakhs bhi hai jisne tanhai mein Allah ko yad kya to uski aankhon se aansu jari ho gaey. ''"
"6480","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''pichhlii ummaton mein ka, aik shakhs jisey apne burey amalon ka dar tha. us ne apne ghar walon se kaha ke jab main mar jaun to meri laash reza reza karke garm din mein utha ke dariya mein daal dena. iske ghar walon ne iske sath aisa hi kya phir Allah Taala ne usey jama kya aur us se puchha ke ye jo tum ne kya uski wjah kya hai? us shakhs ne kaha ke parwardigar mujhey is par sirf terey khof ne aamada kya, chunanche Allah Taala ne uski maghfirat farma di."
"6481","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pichhli ummaton ke aik shakhs ka zikr farmaya ke Allah Taala ne usey maal w aulad ata farmai thi. farmaya ke jab uski maut ka waqt aaya to usne apne ladkon se poochha, bap ki haisiyat se maine kaisa apne aapko Sabit kya? ladkon ne kaha ke behtreen bap . phir us shakhs ne kaha ke usne Allah ke paas koi neki nahi jama ki hai. Qatada ne ( لم يبتئر ( ki tafseer ( لم يدخر (ke nahi jama ki, se ki hai. aur us ne ye bhi kaha ke agar usey Allah ke huzoor mein pesh kya gaya to Allah Taala usey azab dega (is ne apne ladkon se kaha ke) dekho, jab main mar jaun to meri laash ko jalaa dena aur jab main koila ho jaun to mujhey pees dena aur kisi tez hawa ke din mujhey usmein uda dena. us ne apne ladkon se is par wada liya chunanche ladkon ne uske sath aisa hi kya. phir Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ho jaa. chunanche wo aik mard ki shakl mein khada nazar aaya. phir farmaya, mere bandey! ye jo to ne karaya hai is par tujhey kis cheez ne aamada kya tha? usne kaha ke terey khof ne. Allah Taala ne iska badla ye diya ke is par raham farmaya, maine ye hadis Usman se bayan ki to unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Salman se suna. albatta unhon-ne ye lafz bayan kiye ke ''mujhey dariya mein baha dena ''yaa jaisa ke unhon-ne bayan kya aur Muaz ne bayan kya ke ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne, unhon-ne Aqba se suna, unhon-ne abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se suna aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6482","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meri aur jo kuchh kalaamullaah ne mere sath bheja hai uski misal aik aisey shakhs jaisi hai jo apni qaum ke paas aaya aur kaha ke maine (tumhaarey dushman ka ( lashkar apni aankhon se dekha hai aur main waazeh daraane wala hun. to bhaago, bhaago (apni jaan bachaao) is par aik jamat ne uski baat maan li aur raat hi raat itminan se kisi mehfooz jagah par nikal gaey aur nijat paaii. lekin dusri jamat ne usey jhutlaayaa aur dushman ke lashkar ne subah ke waqt achcha unhein aa liya aur tabah kar diya. ''"
"6483","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri aur logon ki misal aik aisey shakhs ki hai jisne aag jalaaii, jab uske charon taraf roshni ho gaee to parwaaney aur ye keedey makodey jo aag par girtey hain usmein girney lagey aur aag jalaaney wala unhein usmein se nikalney laga lekin wo iske qaabu mein nahi aaey aur aag mein girtey rahe. isi tarah mein tumhari kamar ko pakad kar aag se tumhen nikaaltaa hon aur tum ho ke usi mein girtey jatey ho."
"6484","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' musalman wo hai jo musalmanon ko apni zaban aur hath se ( takleef pahunchne se) mehfooz rakhey aur muhajir wo hai jo un chizon se ruk jaey jis se Allah ne mana kya hai.''"
"6485","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kya kartey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar tumhen wo malum ho jaey jo main janta hun to tum hanstey kam aur rotey zyaada.''"
"6486","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar tumhen wo malum hota jo main janta hun to tum hanstey kam aur rotey zyada .''"
"6487","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' dozakh khuwaahishaate-nafsaanii se dhak di gaee hai aur jannat mushkilaat aur dushwaariyon se dhakii hui hai.''"
"6488","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat tumharey jootey ke tasmey se bhi zyada tumharey qareeb hai aur isi tarah dozakh bhii.''"
"6489","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse sachcha sher jisey shaair ne kaha hai ye hai ''haan Allah ke siwa tamam cheezein be-buniyaad hain.''"
"6490","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tum maine koi shakhs kisi aisey aadmi ko dekhey jo maal aur shakl w sura mein us se badh kar hai to usey aisey shakhs ka dhyaan karna chahiye jo us se kam darje ka hai.''"
"6491","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik hadeese-qudsi mein farmaya ''Allah taala ne nekiyan aur buraaiyaan muqaddar kar di hain aur phir unhein saaf-saaf bayan kar diya hai. to jisne kisi neki ka irada kya lekin is par amal na kar saka to Allah Taala ne uske liye aik mukammal neki ka badla likha hai aur agar us ne irade ke baad is par amal bhi kar liya to Allah Taala ne uske liye apne yahan das guna se saat so guna tak nekiyan likhi hain aur us se badh kar aur jisne kisi burai ka irada kya aur phir is par amal nahi kya to Allah Taala ne uske liye apne yahan neki likhi hai aur agar us ne irada ke baad is par amal bhi kar liya to apne yahan uske liye aik burai likhi hai."
"6492","tum aisey-aisey amal kartey ho jo tumhari nazar mein baal se zyada baareek hain (tum usey haqeer samajhtey ho, bada gunah nahi samajhtey) aur ham log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein un kaamon ko halaak kar dene wala samajhtey they. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke hadis mein jo lafz (moobiqaat) hai iska mana halaak karne waale."
"6493","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko dekha jo mushrekeen se jang mein masroof tha, ye shakhs musalmanon ke saahibe-maal w daulat logon mein se tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar koi chahta hai ke kisi jahannami ko dekhey to wo us shakhs ko dekhey. is par aik sahabi us shakhs ke peechhey lag gaey wo shakhs barabar ladtaa raha aur aakhir zakhmi ho gaya. phir us ne chaha ke jaldi mar jaey. to apni talwaar hi ki dhaar apne seeney ke darmyan rakh kar is par apne aapko daal diya aur talwaar iske shaanon ko cheertii hui nikal gaee (is tarah wo khudkushii karke mar gaya) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke banda logon ki nazar mein ahle-jannat ke kaam karta rehta hai halanke wo jahannam mein se hota hai. aik doosra banda logon ki nazar mein ahale-jahannam ke kaam karta rehta hai halanke wo jannati hota hai aur aamaal ka eitibaar to khaatme par tikaa hua hai."
"6494","sawal kya gaya : aey Allah ke rasool! Muhammad-bin Yusuf ne bayan kya, unse Auzai ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne bayan kya, unse Ata-bin-Yazeed Lesi ne bayan kya aur unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke aik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur puchha : ya Rasulullah ! kon shakhs sabse achchha hai? farmaya ke wo shakhs jisne apni jaan aur maal ke zariey jihad kya aur wo shakhs jo kisi pahaad ki khoh mein thehra hua apne rab ki ibadat karta hai aur logon ko apni burai se mehfooz rakhta hai. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Zubaidi , Sulaiman-bin Kasir aur Nauman ne Zohri se ki. aur Mamar ne Zohri se bayan kya, unse ata ya Ubaidullah ne, unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aur Yunus w ibne- musaafir aur Yahya-bin-Saeed ne ibne-Shahab (Zohri ( se bayan kya, unse Ata ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kisi sahabi ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6495","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke logon par aik aisa dour aayega jab aik musalman ka sabse behtar maal bhedein hongi wo unhein lekar pahaad ki chotiyon aur barish ki jaghon par chala jaeyga us din wo apne Deen ko lekar fasaadon se dar kar wahan se bhag jaeyga"
"6496","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab amanat barbad ki jaey to qiyamat ka intizar karo.'' puchha : ya Rasulullah ! amanat kis tarah barbad ki jaeygi ? farmaya ''jab kaam naa-ahal logon ke sipurd kar diye jayen to qiyamat ka intizar karo.''"
"6497","ham se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do hadisein irshad farmaein . aik ka zuhoor to main dekh chuka hun aur dusri ka muntazir hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya ke amanat logon ke dilon ki gahraaiyon mein utartii hai. phir Quran sharif se, phir hadis sharif se uski mazbootii hoti jati hai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se iske uth janey ke mutaalliq irshad farmaya ke aadmi aik neend soey ga aur (usi mein) amanat uske dil se khatm hogi aur us be-Eimaanii ka halka nishan pad jaeyga phir aik aur neend lega ab iska nishan chhaaley ki tarah ho jaeyga jaisey to paon par aik chingaarii (چنگاری) ludhkaaey to zahir mein aik chhaalaa phool aata hai usko phulaa (پھولا) dekhta hai, par andar kuchh nahi hota. phir haal ye ho jaeyga ke subah uth kar log khareed w farokht karengey aur koi shakhs amanat daar nahi hoga, kaha jaeyga ke bani falan mein aik amanat daar shakhs hai. kisi shakhs ke mutaalliq kaha jaeyga ke kitna aqlmand hai, kitna buland hosla hai aur kitna bahaadur hai. halanke uske dil mein raai barabar bhi eman (amaanat) nahi hoga.'' ( Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain) maine aik aisa waqt bhi guzara hai ke main uski parwaa nahi karta tha ke kis se khareed w farokht karta hun. agar wo musalman hota to usko Islam (be-Eimaanii se) roktaa tha. agar wo nasrani hota to uska madadgaar usey roktaa tha lekin ab main falan aur falan ke siwa kisi se khareed w farokht hi nahi karta."
"6498","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke logon ki misal oonton ki si hai qareeb hai ke to unmein se aik ko bhi sawari ke qaabil na paaey."
"6499","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur maine aap ke siwa kisi ko ye kehtey nahi suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, chunanche main unke qareeb pahuncha to maine suna ke wo keh rahe they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (kisi nek kaam ke nateeje mein) jo shohrat ka taalib ho Allah Taala uski bad-niyati qiyamat ke din sab ko suna dega. isi tarah jo koi logon ko dikhaaney ke liye nek kaam karega Allah bhi qiyamat ke din usko sab logon ko dikhla dega."
"6500","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey betha hua tha. siwa kajaawa ke aakhiri hissey ke mere aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darmyan koi cheez haail nahi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey Muaz ! maine arz kya labbaik va sa'deik (وسعدیک) , ya Rasulullah ! phir thodi der Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaltey rahe phir farmaya, aey Muaz ! maine arz kya labbaik va sa'deik (وسعدیک) ya Rasulullah ! phir thodi der mazeed Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaltey rahe. phir farmaya, aey Muaz ! maine arz kya labbaik va sa'deik (وسعدیک) ya Rasulullah ! farmaya, tumhen malum hai ke Allah ka apne bandon par kya haq hai? maine arz kya Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. farmaya, Allah ka bandon par ye haq hai ke wo Allah hi ki ibadat karein aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik na thehraein . phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) thodi der chaltey rahe aur farmaya, aey Muaz-bin-Jabal ! maine arz kya labbaik va sa'deik (وسعدیک) ya Rasulullah ! farmaya, tumhen malum hai ke jab bandey ye kar lein to unka Allah par kya haq hai? maine arz kya Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. farmaya ke bandon ka Allah par ye haq hai ke wo unhein azab na de."
"6501","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik ontni thi (doosri sanad) imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha aur mujh se Muhammad-bin salam ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko fazari ne aur abu-Khalid Ahmar ne khabar di, unhein Humaid taweel ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik ontni thi jiska naam azbaa tha (koii janwar daud mein) us se aagey nahi badh paata tha. phir aik dehati apne oont par Sawar ho kar aaya aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ontni se aagey badh gaya. musalmaanon par ye mamla bada sakht guzra aur kehney lagey ke afsos azbaa peechhey reh gaee. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke Allah Taala ne apne uper ye lazim kar liya hai ke jab duniya mein wo kisi cheez ko badhata hai to usey wo ghataataa bhii hai."
"6502","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke jisne mere kisi wali se dushmanii ki usey meri taraf se ea'laane jang hai aur mera banda jin jin ibaadaton se mera qurb hasil karta hai aur koi ibadat mujh ko is se zyada pasand nahi hai jo maine is par farz ki hai (yani faraaiz mujh ko bahut pasand hain jaisey namaaz, roza, Haj, zakaat) aur mera banda farz ada karne ke baad nafl ibaadatein karke mujh se itna nazdeek ho jata hai ke main us se mohabbat karne lag jata hun. phir jab main us se mohabbat karne lag jata hun to main us-ka kaan bin jata hun jis se wo sunta hai, uski aankh bin jata hun jis se wo dekhta hai, uska hath bin jata hun jis se wo pakadta hai, uska paon bin jata hun jis se wo chalta hai aur agar wo mujh se mangta hai to main usey deta hun agar wo kisi dushman ya shaitan se meri panah mangta hai to main usey mehfooz rakhta hun aur main jo kaam karna chahta hun usmein mujhey itna tardduud nahi hota jitna ke mujhey apne momin bandey ki jaan nikalney mein hota hai. wo to maut ko  jismaanii takleef ki wajah se pasand nahi karta aur mujh ko bhi usey takleef dena bura lagta hai."
"6503","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main aur qiyamat itney nazdeek-nazdeek bhejey gaey hain aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni do ungliyon ke ishara se (is nazdiiki (نزدیکی) ko) bataya phir un donon ko phailaayaa.''"
"6504","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main aur qiyamat in donon (ungliyon) ki tarah (nazdeek-nazdeek) bhejey gaey hain.''"
"6505","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main aur qiyamat in do ki tarah bhejey gaey hain. aap ki murad do ungliyon se thii.'' Abu-Bakar bin Ayash ke sath is hadis ko Israel ne bhi abu-Haseen se riwayat kya hai."
"6506","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat us waqt tak qaaim na hogi jab tak suraj maghrib se na niklega . jab suraj maghrib se niklega aur log dekh lengey to sab eman ley aaeingey, yahi wo waqt hoga jab kisi ko uska eman nafa nahi dega jo is se pahley eman na laya hoga ya jisne eman ke baad amal khair na kya ho. isliye qiyamat aa jaeygi aur do aadmi kapda darmyan mein (khareed w farokht ke liye) phailaey huey hongey. abhi khareed w farokht bhi nahi hui hogi aur na unhon-ne usey lapeta hi hoga (ke qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi) aur qiyamat us haal mein qaaim ho jaeygi ke aik shakhs apni ontni ka doodh lekar aa raha hoga aur usey pi bhi nahi sakega aur qiyamat us haal mein qaaim ho jaeygi ke aik shakhs apna hauz taiyaar kara raha hoga aur iska pani bhi na pi paaey ga. qiyamat us haal mein qaaim ho jaeygi ke aik shakhs apna luqma apne munh ki taraf uthaaeyga aur usey khaney bhi na paaey ga.''"
"6507","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs Allah se milney ko mahboob rakhta hai, Allah bhi us se milney ko mahboob rakhta hai aur jo Allah se milney ko pasand nahi karta hai Allah bhi us se milney ko pasand nahi kartaa.'' aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kuchh beeviyon ne arz kya ke marnaa to ham bhi nahi pasand kartey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke milney se maut murad nahi hai balke baat ye hai ke emaandaar aadmi ko jab maut aati hai to usey Allah ki khushnoodii aur uske yahan uski izzat ki khushkhabri di jati hai. us waqt momin ko koi cheez us se zyada azeez nahi hoti jo iske aagey (Allah se mulaqat aur uski raza aur jannat ke husool ke liye) hoti hai, isliye wo Allah se mulaqat ka khaahishmand ho jata hai aur Allah bhi uski mulaqat ko pasand karta hai aur jab kaafir ki maut ka waqt qareeb aata hai to usey Allah ke azab aur uski saza ki bashaarat di jati hai, us waqt koi cheez iske dil mein us se zyada na-gawar nahi hoti jo iske aagey hoti hai. wo Allah se ja milney ko na-pasand karne lagta hai, isliye Allah bhi us se milney ko na-pasand karta hai. Abu-Dawood Tiyalisi aur Amr-bin marzooq ne us hadis ko Shoba se mukhtesar taur (مختصراً) per riwayat kya hai aur Saeed-bin-abi-Aruba ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne, unse zaraarah  (زرارہ) bin abi ufa'a ne, unse Sad ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya."
"6508","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs Allah se milney ko pasand karta hai Allah bhi us se milney ko pasand karta hai aur jo shakhs Allah se milney ko na-pasand karta hai Allah bhi us se milney ko na-pasand karta hai.''"
"6509","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab aap khaasey tandurust they farmaya tha kisi Nabi ki us waqt tak Rooh qabz nahi ki jati jab tak jannat mein uske rehney ki jagah usey dikhaa na di jati ho aur phir usey (duniyaa ya aakhirat ke liye) ikhtiyar diya jata hai. phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar huey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sar Mubarak meri raan par tha to aap par thodi der ke liye ghashii chhaa gaee, phir jab aapko hosh aaya to aap chhat ki taraf tak-takii (ٹکٹکی) laga kar dekhney lagey. phir farmaya (اللهم الرفيق الأعلى) maine kaha ke ab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein tarjeeh nahi de saktey aur main samajh gaee ke ye wahi hadis hai jo aap ne aik martaba irshad farmai thi. rawi ne bayan kya ke ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aakhiri kalima tha jo aap ne apni zabaane Mubarak se ada farmaya yani ye irshad ke (اللهم الرفيق الأعلى) yani ya Allah ! mujh ko buland doston ka sath pasand hai."
"6510","unhein Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke ghulam abu-Amr-zakwaan ne khabar di ke Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) kaha karti thin ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki wafat ke waqt) aap ke samney aik bada pani ka piyala rakha hua tha jis mein pani tha. ye umr ko shubeh hua ke handi ka koondaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna hath us bartan mein daltey aur phir us hath ko apne chehra par maltey aur farmatey Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi, bila shubah maut mein takleef hoti hai, phir aap apna hath utha kar farmaney lagey (في الرفيق الأعلى) yahan tak ke aap ki Rooh Mubarak qabz ho gaee aur aap ka hath jhuk gaya."
"6511","kuch deihaatii jo nangey paon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aatey they aur aap se malum kartey they ke qiyamat Kab aaeygii? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unmein se kam Umr waley ko dekh kar farmaney lagey ke agar ye bachcha zinda raha to iske budhapey se pahley tum par tumhari qiyamat aa jaeygi. Hisham ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad (qiyamat se) unki maut thi."
"6512","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb se log aik janaaza lekar guzrey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (مستريح) ya (مستراح) hai yani usey aaraam mil gaya, ya us se aaraam mil gaya. sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ''المستریح او المستراح منہ'' ka kya matlab hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin banda duniya ki mashaqqaton aur takleefon se Allah ki rehmat mein nijat pa jata hai wo (مستريح) hai aur (مستراح منہ) wo hai ke faajir (badkaar) bandey se Allah ke bandey, shahar, darakht aur chaupaaey sab aaraam pa jatey hain."
"6513","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye marney wala ya to aaraam paaney wala hai ya doosrey bandon ko aaraam dene wala hai."
"6514","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''maiyat ke sath teen cheezein chaltii hain do to wapas aa jati hain sirf aik kaam uske sath reh jata hai, iske saath, iske ghar waale, iska maal aur iska a'mal chalta hai iske ghar waley aur maal to wapas aa jata hai aur iska a'mal iske sath baqi reh jata hai.''"
"6515","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''jab tum mein se koi martaa hai to subah w Sham (jab tak wo barzakh mein hai) uske rehney ki jagah usey har roz dikhai jati hai ya dozakh ho ya jannat aur kaha jata hai ke ye terey rehney ki jagah hai yahan tak ke to uthaya jaey (yani qiyamat ke din tak).''"
"6516","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo log mar gaey unko bura na kaho kyonke jo kuchh unhon-ne aagey bheja tha uske paas wo khud pahunch chukey hain, unhon-ne burey bhaley (بھلے) jo bhi a'mal kiye they waisaa badla pa liyaa.''"
"6517","do aadmiyon ne aapas mein gali galoch ki. jin mein se aik musalman tha aur doosra Yahudi tha. musalman ne kaha ke us parwardigar ki qism jisne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tamam jahan par paakiizaa kya. Yahudi ne kaha ke us parwardigar ki qism jisne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko tamam jahan par paakiizaa kya. rawi ne bayan kya ke musalman Yahudi ki baat sun kar khafa ho gaya aur uske munh par aik tamaancha raseed kya. wo Yahudi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apna aur musalman ka Sara waqia bayan kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''dekho Musa (Alaihissalam) par mujh ko fazeelat mat do kyonke qiyamat ke din aisa hoga ke soour phoonktey hi tamam log behosh ho jaeinge aur main sabse pahlaa shakhs hunga jisey hosh aayega . main kya dekhunga ke Musa (Alaihissalam) arsh ilahi ka kouna (کونہ) thaamey huey hain. mujhey nahi malum ki Musa (Alaihissalam) bhi un logon mein hongey jo behosh huey they aur phir mujh se pahley hi hosh mein aagey they ya unmein se hongey jinhein Allah Taala ne us se mustashnaa (apwaad) kar diyaa.''"
"6518","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke be-hoshii ke waqt tamam log behosh ho jaeinge aur sabse pahley uthney wala mein hunga . us waqt Musa (Alaihissalam) arsh ilahi ka kounaa (کونہ) thaamey hongey. ab main nahi janta ke wo behosh bhi hongey ya nahi. us hadis ko Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya hai."
"6519","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala zameen ko apni muththii mein ley lega aur aasmanon ko apne daain hath mein lapet lega , phir farmaeyga ke ab main hun baadshaah, aaj zameen ke badshah kahan gaey?''"
"6520","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din saari zameen aik roti ki tarah ho jaeygi jisey Allah Taala ahle-jannat ki mezbaanii ke liye apne hath se ultey-paltey ga jis tarah tum dastar-khuwaan par roti lahraatey phiraatey ho. phir aik Yahudi aaya aur bola : abul-Qaasim ! tum par Rehman barkat nazil karey kya main tumhen qiyamat ke din ahle-jannat ki sabse pehli mehmaan-nawaazii ke barey mein khabar na dun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, kyon nahi. to usne (bhi yahii) kaha ke saari zameen aik roti ki tarah ho jaeygi jaisa ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamari taraf dekha aur muskuraaey jis se aap ke aagey ke daant dikhai dainey lagey. phir (is ne) khud hi puchha kya main tumhen iske saalan ke mutaalliq khabar na dun? (phir khud hi) bola ke unka saalan      (بالام ونون) hoga. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye kya cheez hai? usne kaha ke bail aur machhli jiski kalejii ke sath ziyaadaa charbi ke hissey ko sattar (70) hazaar aadmi khaaengey."
"6521","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din logon ka hashr safaid w surkhi aamez zameen par hoga jaisey maidey ki roti saaf w safaid hoti hai. us zameen par kisi (cheez) ka koi nishan na hoga.''"
"6522","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''logon ka hashr teen firqon mein hoga (eik firqey waale) log dilchasbii karne waaley, oosii ke sath darney waley hongey. (doosraa firqa aisey logon ka hoga ke) aik oont par do aadmi sawar hongey kisi oont par teen hongey, kisi oont par char hongey aur kisi par dus hongey aur baqi logon ko aag jama karegi (ahaley shirk ka ye tesraa firqa hoga) jab wo qailula karengey to aag bhi unke sath thahrii hogi jab wo raat guzaarein gey to aag bhi unke sath wahan thahrii hogi jab wo subah karengey to aag bhi subah ke waqt wahan maujood hogi aur jab wo Sham (Syria) karengey to aag bhi Sham ke waqt unke sath maujood hogi. ''"
"6523","aik sahabi ne kaha, aey Allah ke Nabi ! qiyamat mein kaafiron ko unke chehrey ke bal kis tarah hashr kya jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo zaat jisne unhein duniya mein do paon par challaayaa usey is par qudrat nahi hai ke qiyamat ke din unhein chehrey ke bal chala de. Qat'ada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke zaroor hai, hamarey rab ki izzat ki qasam, beshak wo munh ke bal chala sakta hai."
"6524","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum Allah se qiyamat ke din nangey paaun, nangey badan aur paidal chal kar bin khatna milo-gey. '' Sufiyan ne kaha ke ye hadis un (nau (9) ya dus hadeeson) mein se hai jinke mutaalliq ham samajhtey hain ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khud unko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"6525","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke aap member par khutbey mein farma rahe they ke tum Allah Taala se us haal mein milo gey ke nangey paaun, nangey jism aur baghair khatna ho gey."
"6526","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein khutba dene ke liye khadey huey aur farmaya ''tum log qiyamat ke din is haal mein jama kiye jaogey ke nangey paon aur nangey jism hogey. jaisa ke Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ''jis tarah ham ne shuru mein paida kya tha isi tarah lota dengey. '' aur tamam makhlooqat mein sabse pahley jisey kapda pahnaayaa jaeyga wo Ibrahim hongey aur meri ummat ke bahut se log laey jaeinge jinke aamaal naamey baaein hath mein hongey. main is par kahunga : aey mere rab! ye to mere sathi hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga tumhen malum nahi ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya-kya naii-naii bad-duaa nikaalii thin. us waqt main bhi wahi kahunga jo nek bandey (Eisaa (Alaihissalam) ( ne kaha ( وكنت عليهم شهيدا ما دمت فيهم‏ (ke '' ya Allah ! main jab tak unmein maujood raha us waqt tak mein un par gawah tha.'' Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke Farishtey ( mujh se) kahengey ke ye log hamesha apni eidiyon ke bal phirtey hi rahe (murtad hotey rahe ( ."
"6527","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum nangey paaun, nangey jism, bila khatna ke uthaey jaogey. ''Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) farmati hain ke is par maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! to kya mard auratein aik doosrey ko dekhtey hongey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us waqt mamla us se kahin zyada sakht hoga, iska khayal bhi koi nahi kar sakega."
"6528","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik kheme mein they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par razi ho ke ahle-jannat ka aik chothai raho ? ham ne kaha ke ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par razi ho ke ahle-jannat ka tum aik tehai raho ? ham ne kaha ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tum is par razi ho ke ahle-jannat ka tum aadhey raho? ham ne kaha ji haan. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai, mujhey ummeed hai ke tum log ( ummat Muslima ( ahle-jannat ka hissa hogey aur aisa isliye hoga ke jannat mein farmaanbardaar nafs ke ilawa aur koi dakhil na hoga aur tum log shirk karne walon ke darmyan ( tadaad mein) is tarah hogey jaisey siyah bail ke jism par safaid baal hotey hain ya jaisey surkh ke jism par aik siyah baal ho."
"6529","qiyamat ke din sabse pahley Adam (Alaihissalam) ko pukara jaeyga phir unki nasl unko dekhegii to kaha jaeyga ke ye tumharey buzurg dada Adam hain. ( pukarney par) wo kahengey ke labbaik w sa'daik . Allah Taala farmaeyga ke apni nasl mein se dozakh ka hissa nikaal lo. Adam (Alaihissalam) arz karengey aey parwardigar ! kitnon ko nikaalun ? Allah Taala farmaeyga feesad ( ninyaanwe feesad dozakhi aik jannati ( . sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! jab ham mein so mein ninyaanwe nikal diye jayen to phir baqi kya reh jaeinge ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tamam ummaton mein meri ummat itni hi tadaad mein hogi jaisey siyah bail ke jism par safaid baal hotey hain."
"6530","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala farmaeyga, aey Adam ! Adam (Alaihissalam) kahengey hazir hun, farmaan- bardaar hun aur har bhalai terey hath mein hai. Allah Taala farmaeyga jo log jahannam mein daley jaeinge unhein nikaal lo. Adam (Alaihissalam) poochhein gey jahannam mein daley janey waley log kitney hain? Allah Taala farmaeyga ke har aik hazaar mein se nau (9) sou ninyaanwe . yahi wo waqt hoga jab bachchey gham se boodhey ho jaeinge aur haamla auratein apna hamal gira dein gii aur tum logon ko nashey ki haalat mein dekhogey, halanke wo waqei nashey ki haalat mein na hongey balke Allah ka azab sakht hoga. sahaba ko ye baat bahut sakht malum hui to unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! phir ham mein se wo (khush naseeb) shakhs kon hoga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen khushkhabri ho, aik hazaar yaajooj maajooj ki qaum se hongey aur tum mein se wo aik jannati hoga phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, mujhey ummeed hai ke tum log ahle-jannat ka aik tehai hissey hogey . rawi ne bayan kya ke ham ne is par Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur uski takbeer kahi. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai mujhey ummeed hai ke aadha hissey ahle-jannat ka tum log ho gey. tumhari misal dusri ummaton ke muqaabley mein aisi hai jaisey kisi siyah bail ke jism par safaid baalon ki (ma'moolii ta'daad) hoti hai ya wo safaid dagh jo gadhey ke aagey ke paon par hota hai."
"6531","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( يوم يقوم Naas لرب العالمين‏ ( ki tafseer mein farmaya ke tum mein se har koi sarey jahaanon ke parwardigar ke aagey khada hoga is haal mein ke uska paseena kanon ki lo tak pahuncha hua hoga."
"6532","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din log pasiney mein sharaabor ho jaeinge aur haalat ye ho jaeygi ke tum mein se har kisi ka paseena zameen par 70 hath tak phail jaeyga aur munh tak pahunch kar kanon ko chhooney lagega.''"
"6533","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sabse pahley jis cheez ka faisla logon ke darmyan hoga wo nahaq khoon ke badla ka hoga.''"
"6534","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne apne kisi bhai par zulm kya ho to usey chahiye ke us se (is duniya mein) maaf kara ley. isliye ke aakhirat mein rupye-paisey nahi hongey. us se pahley ( maaf kara ley (ke uske bhai ke liye uski nekiyon mein se haq dilaya jaeyga aur agar uske paas nekiyan na hongi to us ( mazloom ( bhai ki buraaiyaan is par daal di jaaeingii.''"
"6535","us aayat ke barey main (ونزعنا ما في صدورهم من غل‏) kahaa ke ham se Saeed ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne bayan kya, unse abu-mutwakkil naajii ne aur unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momineen jahannam se chhutkara pa jaeinge lekin dozakh aur jannat ke darmyan aik pul par unhein rok liya jaeyga aur phir aik ke doosrey par un mazaalim ka badla liya jaeyga jo duniya mein unke darmyan aapas mein huey they aur jab kaat-chhaant kar li jaeygi aur safaaii ho jaeygi tab unhein jannat mein dakhil honey ki ijazat milegii. to us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai ! jannatiyon mein se har koi jannat main apne ghar ko duniya ke apne ghar ke muqable mein zyada behtar tareeqey par pehchan lega.''"
"6536","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jiske hisab mein khod-kured ki gaee usko zaroor azab hoga.'' wo kehti hain ke maine arz kya : kya Allah Taala ka ye farman nahi hai) فسوف يحاسب حسابا يسيرا‏ ( '' phir an-qareeb unse halka hisab liya jaaeyga.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is se murad sirf peshii hai."
"6537","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs se bhi qiyamat ke din hisab liya gaya to wo halaak hua. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya Allah Taala ne khud nahi farmaya hai) فأما من أوتي كتابه بيمينه * فسوف يحاسب حسابا يسيرا‏ (ke '' to jiska naamaae-aa'maal iske daain hath mein diya gaya to an-qareeb us se aik aasan hisab liya jaaeyga.'' is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to sirf peshii hogi. ( Allah rabbul-izzat ke kehney ka matlab ye hai ke) qiyamat ke din jiske bhi hisab mein khod kured ki gaee usko azab yaqeeni hoga."
"6538","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they ke qiyamat ke din kaafir ko laya jaeyga aur us se puchha jaeyga ke tumhara kya khayal hai ke agar zameen bhar kar tumharey paas sona ho to kya sab ko (apni nijat ke liye) fidye mein de doge? wo kahega ke haan, to us waqt us se kaha jaeyga ke tum se us se bahut aasan cheez ka (duniyaa mein) mutalba kya gaya tha."
"6539","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein har-har fard se Allah Taala qiyamat ke din is tarah kalam karega ke Allah ke aur bandey ke darmyan koi tarjuman nahi hoga. phir wo dekhega to iske aagey koi cheez nazar nahi aaeygi. phir wo apne samney dekhega aur uske samney aag hogi. to tum mein se jo shakhs bhi chahey ke wo aag se bachey to wo Allah ki raah mein khair khairat karta rahe, chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey ke zariey hi mumkin ho."
"6540","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam se bacho, phir aap ne chehra pher liya, phir farmaya ke jahannam se bacho aur phir uske baad chehra Mubarak pher liya, phir farmaya jahannam se bacho . teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa hi kya. ham ne us se ye khayal kya ke aap jahannam dekh rahe hain. phir farmaya ke jahannam se bacho chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey hi ke zariey ho sakey aur jisey ye bhi na miley to usey ( logon mein) kisi achi baat kehney ke zariey se hi (jahannam se) bchney ki koshish karni chahiye"
"6541","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere samney ummatein pesh ki gain kisi Nabi ke sath poori ummat guzri , kisi Nabi ke sath chand aadmi guzrey, kisi Nabi ke sath das aadmi guzrey , kisi Nabi ke sath panch aadmi guzrey aur koi Nabi tanha guzraa. phir maine dekha to insanon ki aik bahut badi jamat door se nazar aai. maine Jibraeel se puchha kya ye meri ummat hai? unhon-ne kaha nahi balke ufuq ki taraf dekho . maine dekha to aik bahut zabardast jamat dikhai di. farmaya ke ye hai aap ki ummat aur ye jo aagey-aagey 70 hazaar ki tadaad hai un logon se hisab na liya jaeyga aur na un par azab hoga. maine puchha : aisa kyon hoga? unhon-ne kaha ke uski wjah ye hai ke ye log dagh nahi lagwaatey they. dam-jhaad nahi karwatey they, shagoon nahi letey they, apne rab par bharosa kartey they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin (Raziallahu anhu) uth kar badhey aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! dua farmaein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi un logon mein kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmai ke aey Allah ! unhein bhi unmein se kar de. iske baad aik aur sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya ke mere liye bhi dua farmaein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ukasha usmein tum se aagey badh gaey."
"6542","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ki aik jamat jannat mein dakhil hogi jiski tadaad 70 hazaar hogi. unke chehrey is tarah roshan hongey jaisey chaudahween raat ka chaand roshan hota hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke is par ukaasha-bin-Mohsin Asadi (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey, apni dhaarii daar kamlii jo unke jism par thi, uthatey huey arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki ke aey Allaah! unhein bhi unmein se kar de. iske baad aik aur sahabi khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! dua kijiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ukasha tum se aagey badh gaey."
"6543","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein meri ummat ke 70 hazaar ya saat (7) laakh ( rawi ko unmein se kisi aik tadaad mein shak tha) aadmi is tarah dakhil hongey ke kuchh log kuchh ko pakdey huey hongey aur is tarah unmein ke agley pichhley sab jannat mein dakhil ho jaeinge aur unke chehrey chaudahwiin raat ke chaand ki tarah roshan hongey.''"
"6544","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab ahle-jannat jannat main aur ahale-jahannam jahannam mein dakhil ho jaeinge to aik awaz dene wala unke darmyan khada ho kar pukaarega ke aey jahannam waalo! ab tumhen maut nahi aaeygii aur aey jannat waalo! tumhen bhi maut nahi aaeygii balke hamesha yahin rehna hoga.''"
"6545","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ahle-jannat se kaha jaeyga ke aey ahle-jannat ! hamesha (tumhein yahin ( rehna hai, tumhen maut nahi aaeygii aur ahale-dozakh se kaha jaeyga ke aey dozakh waalo! hamesha (tum ko yahin ( rehna hai, tum ko maut nahi aaeygi.''"
"6546","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke maine jannat mein jhank kar dekha to wahan rehney waley aksar ghareeb log they aur maine jahannam mein jhank kar dekha (shab meraaj mein) to wahan auratein thin."
"6547","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main jannat ke darwazey par khada hua to wahan aksar dakhil hone-waale mohtaaj log they aur mehnat mazdoorii karne waley they aur maaldaar log aik taraf rokey gaey hain, unka hisab leney ke liye baqi hai aur jo log dozakhi they wo to dozakh ke liye bhej diye gaey aur maine jahannam ke darwazey par khadey ho kar dekha to usmein aksar dakhil honey wali auratein thiin.''"
"6548","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab ahle-jannat jannat mein chaley jaeinge aur ahale-dozakh dozakh mein chaley jaeinge to maut ko laya jaeyga aur usey jannat aur dozakh ke darmyan rakh kar zabah kar diya jaeyga phir aik awaz dene wala awaz dega ke aey jannat waalo! tumhen ab maut nahi aaeygii aur aey dozakh waalo! tumhen bhi ab maut nahi aaeygi. is baat se jannati aur zyada khush ho jaeinge aur jahannami aur zyada ghamgeen ho jaaengey.''"
"6549","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ahle-jannat se farmaeyga ke aey jannat waalo! jannati jawab dengey ham hazir hain aey hamarey parwardigaar! teri khush-naseebi hasil karne ke liye. Allah Taala poochhega kya ab tum log khush huey ? wo kahengey ab bhi bhala ham razi na hongey kyonke ab to , tu ney hamein wo sab kuchh de diya jo apni makhlooq ke kisi aadmi ko nahi diya. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke main tumhen is se bhi behtar cheez doonga . jannati kahengey aey rab! is se behtar aur kya cheez hogi ? Allah Taala farmaeyga ke ab main tumharey liye apni raza mandi ko hamesha ke liye daaimii kar doonga yani iske baad kabhi tum par naraz nahi hoonga."
"6550","Haarisa-bin-Suraaqa (Raziallahu anhu) badr ki ladai mein Shahid ho gaey. wo us waqt nau-umr they, to unki walida Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaein aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aapko malum hai ke Harisa se mujhey kitni mohabbat thi, (aap mujhey bataaein) agar wo jannat mein hai to main sabr kar loongii aur sabr par sawab ki ummeedwaar rahoongii aur agar koi aur baat hai to aap dekhengey ke main uske liye kya karti hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke afsos kya tum paagal ho gaee ho? jannat aik hi nahi hai, bahut si jannatein hain aur wo ( Harisa ( jannatul-firdaus mein hai."
"6551","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kaafir ke donon shaanon ke darmyan tez chalney waley ke liye teen din ki masafat ka fasla hoga.''"
"6552","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik darakht hai jiske saaye mein sawar 100 saal tak chalney ke baad bhi usey tay nahi kar sakega. ''"
"6553","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik darakht hoga jiske saaye mein umda aur tez raftaar ghodey par Sawar shakhs 100 saal tak chalta rahega aur phir bhi usey tay na kar sakega. ''"
"6554","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meri ummat mein 70 hazaar ya saat (7) laakh aadmi jannat mein jaengey. '' rawi ko shak hua ke Sehal se kon si tadaad bayan hui thi, '' (wo jannat mein is tarah dakhil hongey ke) wo aik doosrey ko thaamey huey hongey. unka pahlaa abhi andar dakhil na honey paaeyga ke jab tak aakhiri bhi dakhil na ho jaey. unke chehrey chaudahwiin raat ke chaand ki tarah roshan hongey.''"
"6555","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat waley (apne uper ke darjon ke) baalaakhaanon ko is tarah dekhengey jaisey tum aasman mein sitaron ko dekhtey ho.''"
"6556","aur is mein wo us lafz ka izafa kartey they ke ''jaisey tum mashriqii aur maghribii kinaron mein doobtey sitaron ko dekhtey ho. ''"
"6557","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala qiyamat ke din dozakh ke sabse kam azab paaney waley se poochhega agar tumhen poori zameen ki saari cheezein muyassar hon to kya tum unko fidye mein (is azab se nijat paaney ke liye) de doge, wo kahega ke haan! Allah Taala farmaeyga ke maine tum se us se bhi Sehal cheez ka us waqt mutalba kya tha jab tum Adam (Alaihissalam) ki peeth mein they ke mere sath kisi ko Sharik na karna lekin tum ne ( tauheed ka ( inkar kya aur na maanaa aakhir shirk hi kya.''"
"6558","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kuchh log dozakh se shafaat ke zariey niklengey maano ke) ثعارير ( hon.'' Hammad kehtey hain ke maine Amr-bin-Dinar se puchha ke) ثعارير ( kya cheez hai? unhon-ne kaha ke is se murad chhoti kakdiyaan hain aur hua ye tha ke aakhir umr mein Amr-bin-Dinar ke daant gir gaey they. Hammad kehtey hain ke maine Amr-bin-Dinar se kaha : aey abu-Muhammad ! (ye Amr-bin-Dinar ki kunniyat hai) kya aap ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se ye suna hai? unhon-ne bayan kya ke yahan maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam se shafaat ke zariey log niklengey? unhon-ne kaha haan beshak suna hai."
"6559","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik jamat jahannam se niklegii iske baad ke jahannam ki aag ne unko jalaa daala hoga aur phir wo jannat mein dakhil hongey. ahle-jannat unko (jahannamiyon) ke naam se yad karengey. ''"
"6560","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab ahle-jannat jannat main aur ahale-jahannam jahannam mein dakhil ho chukengey to Allah Taala farmaeyga ke jiske dil mein raai ke daane ke barabar bhi eman ho to usey dozakh se nikaal lo. us waqt aisey log nikaley jaeinge aur wo us waqt jal kar koiley ki tarah ho gaey hongey. iske baad unhein ''nehre-hayaat'' (zindagii bakhsh dariya ( mein daala jaeyga us waqt wo is tarah taro-taazaa ho jaeinge jis tarah sailaab ki jagah par koode-karkat ka daana (usi raat ya din mein) ug aata hai ya rawi ne kaha ( حميل السيل (ke bajaey) ( حمية السيل ( kaha hai. yani jahan sailaab ka zor ho aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum ne dekha nahi ke us daane se zard rang ka liptaa hua baa-raunaq paudaa ugtaa hai."
"6561","maine Noman-bin-Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ke din azab ke eitibaar se sabse kam wo shakhs hoga jiske donon qadmon ke nichey aag ka angaara rakha jaeyga aur uski wjah se uska dimagh khol raha hoga."
"6562","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ke din dozkhiyon mein azab ke eitibaar se sabse halka azab paaney wala wo shakhs hoga jiske donon pairon ke nichey 2 angaarey rakh diye jaeinge jinki wjah se uska dimagh khol raha hoga jis tarah handi aur ketli josh khaatii hai."
"6563","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jahannam ka zikr kya aur rukh pher liya aur us se panah maangii. phir jahannam ka zikr kya aur rukh pher liya aur us se panah mangi . iske baad farmaya ke dozakh se bacho sadqa de kar chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey hi ke zariey ho sakey, jisey ye bhi na miley usey chahiye ke achi baat keh kar."
"6564","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aap ke chacha abu-Taalib ka zikr kya gaya tha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mumkin hai qiyamat ke din meri shafaat unke kaam aa jaey aur unhein jahannam mein takhnon tak rakha jaey jis se unka bheja kholtaa rahega."
"6565","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala qiyamat ke din logon ko jama karega. us waqt log kahengey ke agar ham apne rab ke huzoor mein kisi ki shafaat ley jayen to nafa bakhsh Sabit ho sakti hai. mumkin hai ham apni is haalat se nijat pa jaaein. chunanche log Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey aur arz karengey aap hi wo buzurg Nabi hain jinhein Allah Taala ne apne hath se banaya aur aap ke andar apni chhipaaii hui Rooh phoonki aur farishton ko hukm diya to unhon-ne aapko sajda kya, aap hamarey rab ke huzoor mein hamari shafaat karein. wo kahengey ke main to is laaiq nahi hun, phir wo apni khata ko yad karengey aur kahengey ke Nuh ke paas jao, wo sabse pahley rasool hain jinhein Allah Taala ne bhejaa. log Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey lekin wo bhi yahi jawab dengey ke main us laaiq nahi hun. wo apni khata ka zikr karengey aur kahein ke tum Ibrahim ke paas jao jinhein Allah Taala ne apna khaleel banaya tha. log unke paas aaeingey lekin ye bhi yahi kahengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun, apni khata ka zikr karengey aur kahengey ke tum log Musa ke paas jao jin se Allah Taala ne kalam kya tha. log Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jaeinge lekin wo bhi yahi jawab dengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun, apni khata ka zikr karengey aur kahengey ke Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao . log Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jaaeinge, lekin ye bhi kahengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun, Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jao kyonke unke tamam agley pichhley gunah maaf kar diye gaey hain. chunanche log mere paas aaeingey. us waqt main apne rab se ( shafaat ki) ijazat chaahoonga aur sajde mein gir jaaunga . Allah Taala jitni der tak chaahega mujhey sajde mein rehney dega. phir kaha jaeyga ke apna sar utha lo, maango diya jaeyga, kaho suna jaeyga, shafaat karo, shafaat qabool ki jaeygi. main apne rab ki us waqt aisi hamd bayan karunga ke jo Allah Taala mujhey sikhaaeyga. phir shafaat karunga aur mere liye had muqarrar kar di jaeygi aur main logon ko jahannam se nikal kar jannat mein dakhil kar doonga aur isi tarah sajde mein gir jaunga, teesri ya chothi martaba jahannam mein sirf wahi log baqi reh jaeinge jinhein Quran ne rokaa hai (yani jinke jahannam mein hamesha rehney ka zikr Quran mein sarahat ke sath hai) Qatada (Rahmatullahi-alaih) is mauqe par kaha kartey ke is se wo log murad hain jin par jahannam mein hamesha rehna wajib ho gaya hai."
"6566","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik jamat jahannam se Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki shafaat ki wjah se nikley gii aur jannat mein dakhil hogi jinko ( jahannamii) ke naam se pukara jaaeyga.''"
"6568","Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye aik subah ya aik Sham safar karna duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, se badh kar hai aur jannat mein tumhari aik kamaan ke barabar jagah ya aik qadam ke faasley ke barabar jagah duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, se behtar hai aur agar jannat ki aurton mein se koi aurat poori zameen ki taraf jhank kar dekh ley to aasman se lekar zameen tak munawwar kar de aur un tamam ko khushbu se bhar de aur uska dupatta ( duniya aur jo kuch usmein hai) se badh kar hai."
"6569","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein jo bhi dakhil hoga usey uska jahannam ka thikana bhi dikhaya jaeyga ke agar nafarmani ki hoti (to wahan usey jagah miltii (taake wo aur zyada shukr karey aur jo bhi jahannam mein dakhil hoga usey uska jannat ka thikana bhi dikhaya jaeyga ke agar achchhey amal kiye hotey (to wahan jagah miltii) taake uske liye hasarat w afsos ka baais ho."
"6570","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya : ya Rasulullah! qiyamat ke din aap ki shafaat ki khush-naseebi sabse zyada kon hasil karega? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey abu-Huraira! mera bhi khayal tha ke ye hadis tum se pahley aur koi mujh se nahi poochhega, kyonke hadis ke leney ke liye mein tumhari bahut zyada hirs dekha karta hun. qiyamat ke din meri shafaat ki khush-naseebi sabse zyada usey hasil hogi jisne kalima ( لا إله إلا الله ( Khuloos dil se kahaa."
"6571","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main khub janta hun ke ahaley jahannam mein se kon sabse aakhir mein wahan se niklega aur ahle-jannat mein kon sabse aakhir mein usmein dakhil hoga. aik shakhs jahannam se ghutnon ke bal ghisattey huey niklega aur Allah Taala us se kahega ke jao aur jannat mein dakhil ho jao, wo jannat ke paas aayega lekin usey aisa malum hoga ke jannat bhari hui hai. chunanche wo wapas aayega aur arz karega : aey mere rab! maine jannat ko bharaa hua paya , Allah Taala phir us se kahega ke jao aur jannat mein dakhil ho jao. wo phir aayega lekin usey aisa malum hoga ke jannat bhari hui hai wo wapas lautey ga aur arz karega ke aey mere rab! maine jannat ko bharaa hua paya. Allah Taala farmaeyga jao aur jannat mein dakhil ho jao tumhen duniya aur us se dus guna diya jata hai ya (Allah taala farmaeyga ke) tumhen duniya ke dus guna diya jata hai. wo shakhs kahega to mera mazaaq banata hai halanke to shehanshaah hai. maine dekha ke is baat par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans diye aur aap ke aagey ke dandaaney Mubarak zahir ho gaey aur kaha jata hai ke wo jannat ka sabse kam darjey wala shakhs hoga."
"6572","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : kya aap ne abu-Taalib ko koi nafa pahunchaya ?"
"6573","kuchh logon ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya qiyamat ke din ham apne rab ko dekh sakengey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya suraj ko dekhney main tumhen koi dushwari hoti hai jabke is par koi badal (abr) wghaira na ho? sahaba ne arz kya : nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya jab koi badal na ho to tumhen chaudahween raat ke chaand ko dekhney mein koi dushwari hoti hai? sahaba ne arz kya : nahi ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum Allah Taala ko isi tarah qiyamat ke din dekhogey. Allah Taala logon ko jama karega aur kahega ke tum mein se jo shakhs jis cheez ki poojaa-paat kya karta tha wo usi ke peechhey lag jaey. chunanche jo log suraj ki parastish kya kartey they wo uske peechhey lag jaeinge aur jo log chaand ki puja kartey they wo uske peechhey ho lengey. jo log buton ki parastish kartey they wo unke peechhey lag jaeinge aur aakhir mein ye ummat baqi reh jaeygi aur is mein munaafeqeen ki jamat bhi hogi, us waqt Allah Taala unke samney is sura mein aayega jis ko wo pehchantey na hongey aur kahega ke main tumhara rab hun. log kahengey tujh se Allah ki panaah. ham apni jagah par us waqt tak raheingey jab tak ke hamara parwardigar hamarey samney na aaey. jab hamara rab hamarey paas aayega to ham usey pehchan lengey (kyonke wo hashr mein aik baar usko pahley dekh chukey hongey) phir haq taala is sura mein aayega jis ko wo pehchantey hongey aur unse kaha jaeyga (aao mere sath ho lo) main tumhara rab hun ! log kahengey ke to hamara rab hai, phir usi ke peechhey ho jaeinge aur jahannam par pul bana diya jaeyga Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main sabse pahlaa shakhs hunga jo us pul ko paar karunga aur us din rasulon ki dua ye hogi ke aey Allah ! mujh ko salamat rakhiyo . aey Allah ! mujh ko salamat rakhiyo aur wahan Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah aankdey hongey. tum ne Sadan ke kaantey dekhey hain? sahaba kiram ne arz kya ji haan dekhey hain ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo phir Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah hongey albatta uski lambai chaudai Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta. wo logon ko unke aamaal ke mutabiq uchak lengey aur is tarah unmein se kuchh to apne aa'mal ki wjah se halaak ho jaeinge aur kuchh ka aa'mal raai ke daney ke barabar hoga, phir wo nijat pa jaeyga aakhir jab Allah Taala apne bandon ke darmyan faisley se farigh ho jaeyga aur jahannam se unhein nikaalnaa chaahega jinhein nikalney ki uski marzi hogi. yani wo jinhoney kalima (لا إله إلا الله) ki gawahi di hogi aur Allah Taala farishton ko hukm dega ke wo aisey logon ko jahannam se nikaaley. Farishtey unhein sajdon ke nishanat se pehchan lengey kyonke Allah Taala ne aag par haram kar diya hai ke wo ibne-Aadam ke jism mein sajdon ke nishan ko khaaey . chunanche Farishtey un logon ko nikaley gey . ye jal kar koiley ho chukey hongey phir un par pani chhidkaa jaeyga jisey (ماء الحياة) zindagi bakhshney wala pani kehtey hain. us waqt wo is tarah taro-taazaa ho jaeinge jaisey sailaab ke baad zarkhaiz (زرخیز) zameen mein daana ug aata hai. aik aisa shakhs baqi reh jaeyga jiska chehra jahannam ki taraf hoga aur wo kahega aey mere rab! uski badboo ne mujhey pareshan kar diya hai aur uski lipat ne mujhey jhulsaa diya hai aur uski tezi ne mujhey jalaa daala hai, zara mera munh aag ki taraf se dusri taraf pher de. wo isi tarah Allah se dua karta rahega. aakhir Allah Taala farmaeyga agar main tera ye mutalba pura kar dun to kahin to koi dusri cheez maangnii shuru na kar de. wo shakhs arz karega nahi, teri izzat ki qism ! main iske siwa koi dusri cheez nahi maangon ga . chunanche iska chehra jahannam ki taraf se dusri taraf pher diya jaeyga ab iske baad wo kahega . aey mere rab! mujhey jannat ke darwazey ke qareeb kar dijiye. Allah Taala farmaeyga kya tu ney abhi yaqin nahi dilaya tha ke iske siwa aur koi cheez nahi maangey ga. afsos ! aey ibne-Aadam ! to bahut zyada wada khilaf hai. phir wo barabar isi tarah dua karta rahega to Allah Taala farmaeyga ke agar main teri ye dua qabool kar loon to to phir iske ilawa kuchh aur cheez maangney lagey ga. wo shakhs kahega nahi, teri izzat ki qism ! main iske siwa aur koi cheez tujh se nahi maangon ga aur wo Allah se ahad w paiman karega ke iske siwa ab koi aur cheez nahi maangey ga. chunanche Allah Taala usey jannat ke darwazey ke qareeb kar dega. jab wo jannat ke andar ki ne'maton ko dekhega to jitni der tak Allah Taala chaahega wo shakhs khamosh rahega, phir kahega aey mere rab ! mujhey jannat mein dakhil kar de. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke kya tu ney ye yaqin nahi dilaya tha ke ab to iske siwa koi cheez nahi maangey ga. aey ibne-Aadam ! afsos, to kitna wada khilaf hai. wo shakhs arz karega aey mere rab! mujhey apni makhlooq ka sabse bad-bakht banda na banaa. wo barabar dua karta rahega yahan tak ke Allah Taala hans dega. jab Allah hans dega to us shakhs ko jannat mein dakhil honey ki ijazat mil jaeygi. jab wo andar chala jaeyga to us se kaha jaeyga ke falan cheez ki khahish kar chunanche wo uski khahish karega. phir us se kaha jaeyga ke falan cheez ki khahish karo, chunanche wo phir khahish karega yahan tak ke uski khuwaahishaat khatm ho jaeyngi to Allah Taala ki taraf se kaha jaeyga ke teri ye saari khuwaahishaat poori ki jati hain aur itni hi zyada ne'matein aur di jati hain. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi sanad se kaha ke ye shakhs jannat mein sabse aakhir mein dakhil honey wala hoga."
"6574","Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) bhi us waqt Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath baithey huey they aur unhon-ne unki kisi baat par aetraz nahi kya lekin jab Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) hadis ke us tukdey tak pahunchey ke tumhari ye saari khuwaahishaat poori ki jati hain aur itni hi aur zyada ne'matein di jati hain to Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhari ye saari khuwaahishaat poori ki jati hain aur us se dus guna aur zyada ne'matein di jati hain. aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi maine yun hi suna hai, ye sab cheezein aur itni hi aur."
"6575","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ke main tum se pahley hi hauz par maujood rahoonga."
"6576","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main apne hauz par tum se pahley hi maujood rahunga aur tum mein se kuchh log mere samney laey jaeinge phir unhein mere samney se hata diya jaeyga to main kahunga ke aey mere rab! ye mere sathi hain lekin mujh se kaha jaeyga ke aap nahi jantey ke unhon-ne aap ke baad Deen mein kya-kyaa nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thin. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Aasim ne abu-Wayeil se ki, unse Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan farmaayaa."
"6577","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tumhaarey samney hi mera hauz hoga wo itna bada hai jitna (mulk Sham ke do gaanv) jarbaa aur azroohaa ke darmyan fasla hai.''"
"6578","kausar se murad bahut zyada bhalai (khair kaseer) hai jo Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di hai. abu-Bashar ne bayan kya ke maine Saeed-bin-Jubair se kaha ke kuchh logon ka khayal hai ke kausar jannat mein aik nehar hai to unhon-ne kaha ke jo nehar jannat mein hai wo bhi us khair (bhalaaii) ka aik hissa hai jo Allah Taala ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di hai."
"6579","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meraa hauz aik mahiney ki doori ke barabar hoga. uska pani doodh se zyada safaid aur uski khushbu mushk se zyada achi hogi aur uske koozey (gharey) aasmaan ke sitaron ki tadaad ke barabar hongey. jo shakhs usmein se aik martaba pi lega wo phir kabhi bhi (maidaan mahshar mein) piyaasaa na hoga.''"
"6580","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere hauz ki lambai itni hogi jitni iila aur Yaman aur Shahar san'aa ke darmyan ki lambai hai. aur wahan itni badi tadaad mein pyaley hongey jitney aasman ke sitaron ki tadaad hai.''"
"6581","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke main jannat mein chal raha tha ke main aik nehar par pahuncha iske donon kinaron par khauldaar motiyon ke gunbad baney huey they. maine puchha : Jibraeel ! ye kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ye kausar hai jo aap ke rab ne aapko diya hai. maine dekha ke uski khushbu ya mitti tez mushk jaisi thi. rawi ko shak tha."
"6582","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere kuchh sathi hauz par mere samney laey jaeinge aur main unhein pehchan loonga lekin phir wo mere samney se hata diye jaengey. main is par kahunga ke ye to mere sathi hain. lekin mujh se kaha jaeyga ke aapko malum nahi ke unhon-ne aap ke baad kya-kyaa nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thiin.''"
"6583","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main apne hauz kausar par tum se pahley maujood rahoonga. jo shakhs bhi meri taraf se guzrey ga wo iska pani piey ga aur jo iska pani piey ga wo phir kabhi piyaasaa nahi hoga aur wahan kuchh aisey log bhi aaeingey jinhein main pahchaanoon ga aur wo mujhey pahchaanein gey lekin phir unhein mere samney se hata diya jaaeyga.''"
"6584","mein gawahi deta hun ke maine Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis isi tarah suni thi aur wo us hadis mein kuchh zyadti ke sath bayan kartey they. (yani ye ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaaengey ke) main kahunga ke ye to mujh mein se hain) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha jaeyga ke aapko nahi malum ke unhon-ne aap ke baad Deen mein kya- kya nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thin. is par main kahunga ke door hon wo shakhs jisne mere baad Deen mein tabdili kar li thii."
"6585","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din mere sahaba mein se aik jamat mujh par pesh ki jaeygi. phir wo hauz se door kar diye jaengey. mein arz karunga : aey mere rab! ye to mere sahaba hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke tumhen malum nahi ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya-kyaa nai cheezein ghad li thin ? ye log (deen se) ultey paanw wapas lot gaey they.'' (doosri sanad) Shuaib-bin-abii-Hamza ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hawale se (فيجلون) (bajaaey (فيحلؤون)) ke bayan kartey they. aur Aqeel (فيحلؤون) bayan kartey they aur Zubaidi ne bayan kya, unse Zohri ne, unse Muhammad-bin Ali ne, unse Ubaidullah bin abi Raafe ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6586","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' hauz par mere sahaba ki aik jamat aaeygii . phir unhein us se door kar diya jaeyga mein arz karunga mere rab! ye to mere sahaba hain. Allah Taala farmaeyga ke tumhen malum nahi ke unhon-ne tumharey baad kya-kyaa nai cheezein eiijaad kar li thin, ye ultey paon (Islam se) wapas lot gaey they.''"
"6587","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''main (hauz par) khada hunga ke aik jamat mere samney aaeygii aur jab main unhein pehchan loonga to aik shakhs (farishta) mere aur unke darmyan se niklega aur unse kahega ke idhar aao . main kahunga ke kidhar ? wo kahega ke Allah ki qism jahannam ki taraf. main kahunga ke unke halaat kya hain? wo kahega ke ye log aap ke baad ultey paon (deen se) wapas lot gaey they. phir aik aur giroh mere samney aayega aur jab main unhein bhi pehchan loonga to aik shakhs (farishta) mere aur unke darmyan mein se niklega aur unse kahega ke idhar aao . main poochhoon ga ke kahaan? to wo kahega, Allah ki qism ! jahannam ki taraf. main kahunga ke unke halaat kya hain? farishta kahega ke ye log aap ke baad ultey paon wapas lot gaey they. main samajhta hun ke un girohon mein se aik aadmi bhi nahi bachchey ga. un sab ko dozakh mein ley jaengey."
"6588","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere ghar aur mere member ke darmyan ki jagah ka jannat ke baaghon mein se aik baagh hai aur mera member mere hauz par hai."
"6589","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main hauz par tum se pahley maujood hunga ."
"6590","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur shohdaa Uhud ke liye is tarah dua ki jis tarah maiyat ke liye janazey mein dua ki jati hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par tashrif laey aur farmaya logo ! main tum se aagey jaaunga aur tum par gawah rahunga aur main Allah ki qism apne hauz ki taraf us waqt bhi dekh raha hun aur mujhey zameen ke khazaanon ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain ya farmaya ke zameen ki kunjiyaan di gaee hain. Allah ki qism ! main tumharey barey mein is baat se nahi darta ke tum mere baad shirk karogey, albatta us se darta hun ke tum duniya ke laalach mein pad kar aik doosrey se hasad karne lago gey ."
"6591","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hauz ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke (wo itna bada hai) jitni Madina aur san'aa ke darmyan doori hai."
"6592","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye irshad suna, usmein itna zyada hai ke aap ka hauz itna lamba hoga jitni san'aa aur Madina ke darmyan doori hai. is par mustaurid ne kaha : kya aap ne bartanon wali riwayat nahi sunii? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. mustaurid ne kaha ke ke usmein bartan (peeney ke) is tarah nazar aaeingey jis tarah aasman mein sitaarey nazar aatey hain."
"6593","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main hauz par maujood rahunga aur dekhunga ke tum mein se kon mere paas aata hai. phir kuchh logon ko mujh se alag kar diya jaeyga mein arz karunga ke aey mere rab! ye to mere hi aadmi hain aur meri ummat ke log hain. mujh se kaha jaeyga ke tumhen malum bhi hai unhon-ne tumharey baad kya kaam kiye they? Allah ki qism ye musalsal ultey paon laut'tey rahe. (deen Islam se phir gaey) ibne-abi-Mulaika (jo ke ye hadis Asma se riwayat farmatey hain) kaha kartey they ke aey Allah ! ham is baat se teri panah maangtey hain ke ham ultey paon (deen se) lot jayen ya apne Deen ke barey mein fitna mein daal diye jaaein. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke sura mominoon mein jo Allah Taala ka farman hai) أعقابكم تنكصو‏) iska mana bhi yahi hai ke tum Deen se apni eidiyon ke bal ultey phir gaey they yani Islam se murtad ho gaey they."